Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.00,0:00:33.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.50,0:01:20.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《四签名》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:45.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有个年轻漂亮的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a very pretty young woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:47.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走过街来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}crossing the street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.22,0:02:51.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想她可能要到这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I think she may be coming here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.90,0:02:54.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}顺便说一句 我大概看了一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Incidentally, I have glanced over{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.49,0:02:55.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对我工作的最新记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your latest account of my work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.66,0:02:56.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.93,0:03:01.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坦白的讲 我并不赞同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Honestly I cannot congratulate you upon it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.82,0:03:07.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}侦探学是一门非常精确的科学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Detection is, or ought to be, an exact science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.51,0:03:11.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应是观察后的推理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Observation deduction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.36,0:03:12.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要有冷静非感性的大脑研究它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a cold and unemotional subject.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.23,0:03:15.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你试图给它加上浪漫的色彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have attempted to tinge it with romanticism, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.52,0:03:17.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就像把爱情故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which has much the same effect{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.31,0:03:18.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或是一场私奔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as if you worked a love-story or an{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.98,0:03:22.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}变成欧几里德的第五个几何命题一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}elopement into the fifth proposition of Euclid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.30,0:03:23.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一点都不搭调\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who can match that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.66,0:03:29.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有位年轻的女士要见你 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a young lady to see you Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.71,0:03:32.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是玛丽·摩斯坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Mary Morstan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.79,0:03:35.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这名字我一点都没印象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no recollection of the name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:40.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别走 医生 我可能需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't go Doctor, I may need you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.34,0:03:43.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没猜错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.09,0:03:48.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.96,0:03:49.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}摩斯坦女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Morstan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:52.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下午好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good afternoon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.29,0:03:58.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我今天来找你 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have come to you Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.78,0:04:01.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是因为你曾为我的雇主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you once enabled my employer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.21,0:04:02.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希瑟尔· 弗里斯特夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Cecil Forrester, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.29,0:04:05.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}解决了一次小型家庭纠纷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to unravel a minor domestic complication.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.05,0:04:07.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她对你的善意和智慧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was much impressed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.64,0:04:09.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}印象深刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with your kindness and skill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.86,0:04:11.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:27.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想象不出 有什么比我现在的处境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can hardly imagine anything more strange, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.80,0:04:30.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更加… 奇怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}more utterly inexplicable, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:33.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或是更令人费解的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than the situation in which I find myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.37,0:04:35.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说说案情吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}State your case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.48,0:04:37.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱歉 失陪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will, I am sure, excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.49,0:04:40.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的朋友再坐会吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If your friend would be good enough to remain, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.21,0:04:44.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许还需要他的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he might be of inestimable service to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.81,0:04:46.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.58,0:04:58.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}简单的说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Briefly the facts are these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.07,0:05:04.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲是一名派驻到印度的军官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father was an officer in an Indian regiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.71,0:05:08.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我母亲在我还很小的时候就去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother died when I was still quite a child{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.11,0:05:12.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不得不把我送回国内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he was forced to send me home, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.25,0:05:15.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然国内已没有亲戚在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}despite the fact that I had no relatives here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.71,0:05:17.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我被安排在爱丁堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was placed in a{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:18.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个舒适的寄宿学校读书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}comfortable boarding establishment{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.99,0:05:20.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一直在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at Edinburgh, and I remained there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.12,0:05:22.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呆到17岁才离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until I was 17 years of age.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.91,0:05:26.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在那年 我父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In that same year my father, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.63,0:05:29.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个团里资格最老的上尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who was a senior captain of his regiment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.88,0:05:35.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请了一年的假回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}obtained 12 months' leave and returned home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.49,0:05:39.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他到达伦敦后 发电报给我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He telegraphed to me from London to say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:41.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他已平安到达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he had arrived all safe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.39,0:05:43.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我马上到这来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and directed me to come down at once, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.42,0:05:46.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给了我他居住的 朗厄姆旅馆的地址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}giving the Langham Hotel as his address.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.02,0:05:50.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我记得他的电报里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His message, as I remember, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.46,0:05:53.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}充满慈爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was full of love and kindness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:55.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一到伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On reaching London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.59,0:05:58.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就直接去了朗厄姆旅店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I drove straight to the Langham Hotel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.06,0:06:01.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那儿的人告诉我说 确实有一位摩斯坦上尉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and was informed that Captain Morstan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.05,0:06:02.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}住在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was staying there, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.15,0:06:04.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是他已经出去两天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but that he had gone out the night before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:06.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还没有回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and had not returned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:08.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于是我等在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I waited{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.34,0:06:12.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一整天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.92,0:06:15.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有他的任何消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without news of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.84,0:06:21.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那天夜里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.27,0:06:25.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在旅馆经理的建议下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the advice of the manager of the hotel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.99,0:06:30.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我找了警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I communicated with the police, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.84,0:06:34.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第二天又在各种报纸上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the next day we advertised{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:36.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}登了寻人启事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in all the newspapers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.49,0:06:41.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是一点结果都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our inquiries led to no result{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.04,0:06:44.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从那天到现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from that day to this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.95,0:06:46.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有任何关于\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no word has ever been heard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:49.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不幸父亲的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of my unfortunate father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.63,0:07:00.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他这次回来本希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He came home with his heart so full of hope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.28,0:07:03.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找个安静的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to find some peace, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.17,0:07:05.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}享享清福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some comfort, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.54,0:07:07.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没想到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and instead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.75,0:07:17.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么时候失踪的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The date?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.09,0:07:19.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}12月3日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The 3rd of December{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.22,0:07:21.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}十年前的今天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}exactly 10 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.30,0:07:26.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的行李呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His luggage?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.94,0:07:29.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在旅馆里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remained at the hotel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.70,0:07:33.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从那些东西里找不到什么线索…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh there was nothing in it to suggest a clue...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.34,0:07:35.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有一些衣服 一些书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some clothes, some books, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.02,0:07:37.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有很多安达曼岛上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a considerable number of curiosities{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.98,0:07:39.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带回来的古玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the Andaman Islands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.36,0:07:44.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲是那儿的一个军官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father had been one of the officers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.02,0:07:46.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}负责看守犯人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in charge of the convict-guard there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.78,0:07:48.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 这地方有点乱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson this place is a mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.62,0:07:50.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在伦敦有朋友吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had he any friends in town?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.13,0:07:52.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只知道一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only one that we know of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:55.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叫舒尔托少校 和他在一个团里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Major Sholto, of his old regiment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.98,0:07:58.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}驻孟买陆军第三十四团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the 34th Bombay Infantry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:01.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然我联系过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We communicated with the Major, of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.57,0:08:05.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是他似乎不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he did not seem to know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:07.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的好兄弟来到英国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that his brother officer was in England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.07,0:08:09.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是个奇怪的案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a singular case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:18.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还没和你说到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have not yet communicated to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.19,0:08:21.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最奇怪的部分呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the most singular part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.90,0:08:25.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}4年后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}4 years later{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.05,0:08:27.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}泰晤士报上有一则广告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an advertisement had appeared in the Times{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.23,0:08:29.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}征询我的地址\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}asking for the address of Miss Mary Morstan, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.63,0:08:31.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}声称要是回复他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and stating that it would be to her advantage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.97,0:08:33.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就会会有好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to come forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.89,0:08:35.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}广告没有署名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was no name appended.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.17,0:08:38.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那时侯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had at the time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.46,0:08:41.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我刚刚进入希瑟尔 弗里斯特夫人家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just entered the family of Mrs. Cecil Forrester{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.32,0:08:42.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}做家庭教师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the capacity of governess{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.99,0:08:44.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}按照她的建议 我把地址登在了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and on her advice I published my address{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:47.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}报纸的广告专栏上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the advertisement column.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.06,0:08:50.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在同一天有个邮递员送给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That same day there appeared through the post{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.91,0:08:54.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个小纸盒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a small cardboard box addressed to me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.91,0:08:57.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}盒里装的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which I found to contain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.94,0:09:01.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个很大的上等珍珠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a very large and lustrous pearl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.70,0:09:04.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}盒里没有一个字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No word of writing was enclosed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:08.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从那以后 每年的这天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And since then every year upon the same date{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.30,0:09:10.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都会有同样的盒子给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there has always appeared a similar box, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:11.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}里面是同样的珍珠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}containing a similar pearl, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.62,0:09:14.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有任何寄珠人的线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with no clue as to the sender.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.56,0:09:16.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}行家鉴定了之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have been pronounced by an expert{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.18,0:09:17.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说是很稀有的种类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be of a rare variety{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.72,0:09:20.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很值钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and of considerable value.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.33,0:09:23.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们请看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can see for yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.32,0:09:25.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确很上等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that they are very handsome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.28,0:09:36.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的案子很有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your case is most interesting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.11,0:09:41.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有别的情况吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something else has occurred to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.85,0:09:44.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 就在今天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, and no later than today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.05,0:09:47.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是我来找你的原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is why I have come to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:52.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今早我收到一封信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This letter arrived through the post this morning, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:55.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您还是自己读读吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which you will perhaps read for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.11,0:09:58.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请把信封也给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Envelope please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.47,0:10:02.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伦敦的邮戳 9月7日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}London postmark, October 7th.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.45,0:10:05.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}角上有个男人的大拇指印\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man's thumb mark on corner{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.49,0:10:08.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能是邮递员留下的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}probably the postman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.45,0:10:12.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最好的纸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best quality paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.29,0:10:13.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}六便士一包\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sixpence a packet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.73,0:10:16.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这人对信纸和信封都很讲究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Particular man in his stationery.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.84,0:10:18.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.97,0:10:22.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"今晚7时请到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be at the third pillar from the left{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.48,0:10:24.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"莱西厄姆剧场外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}outside the Lyceum Theatre{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.35,0:10:25.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"左数第三根柱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tonight at seven o'clock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.10,0:10:28.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"如您怀疑 可偕友二人同来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you are distrustful bring 2 friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:31.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"您是受了委屈的女子 定将得到公道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a wronged woman and shall have justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.48,0:10:33.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"别带警察来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not bring the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.41,0:10:35.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"要不然 一切都是徒劳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you do, all will be in vain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.19,0:10:36.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"您不知名的朋友"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your unknown friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:39.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, really, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.46,0:10:40.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有点小问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this is a very pretty little problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:42.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你打算怎么办 摩斯坦小姐？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you intend to do, Miss Morstan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.01,0:10:44.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这正是我要问你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well that is exactly what I want to ask you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.81,0:10:46.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我和你一起去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well then you and I shall go together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.65,0:10:48.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生也很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Watson is the very man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.82,0:10:51.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上面说两位朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your correspondent says 2 friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:53.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是他会去吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But would he come?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.55,0:10:54.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall be proud and happy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:56.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为你效力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if I can be of any service.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.45,0:11:00.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们俩太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are both very kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.90,0:11:02.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我生活很孤独\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have led a retired life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.08,0:11:04.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有朋友可以相托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and have no friends whom I could appeal to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.02,0:11:07.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我6点来 行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I am here at 6 it will do, I suppose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.57,0:11:09.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最晚6点 再见 摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes but you must not be later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.58,0:11:11.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye Miss Morstan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.74,0:11:12.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.95,0:11:13.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Au revoir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.95,0:11:15.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Au revoir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.32,0:11:31.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}买束花吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buy a flower dearie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:34.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}买束花吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Buy a flower.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.82,0:11:36.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}买束花吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aw come on dearie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.23,0:11:38.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.26,0:11:42.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多有魅力的女人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a very attractive woman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.47,0:11:45.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最重要的事就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is of the first importance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.84,0:11:47.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要让一个人的特质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not to allow your judgment to be biased{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:49.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}影响了你的判断力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by personal qualities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.70,0:11:51.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个委托人在我看来 仅仅是一个单元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A client to me is a mere unit, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.47,0:11:53.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}问题中的一个元素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a factor in of the problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:55.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你真是个机器人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes, you are a automaton{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:55.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一台计算器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a calculating machine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:12:00.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有时你一点人情味儿都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something positively inhuman in you at times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:01.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assure you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.26,0:12:03.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我生平所见最迷人的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the most winning woman I ever knew{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.70,0:12:05.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毒死了三个孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was hanged for poisoning 3 little children{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.12,0:12:06.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只为了骗取保险金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for their insurance money, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.26,0:12:09.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还认识一个模样无比讨厌的男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the most repellent man of my acquaintance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.57,0:12:12.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}却是个慈善家 捐赠大约25万英镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a philanthropist who has spent nearly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.55,0:12:14.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给伦敦的贫民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a quarter of a million upon the London poor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.01,0:12:15.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 在这件案子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, in this case, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.87,0:12:18.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从不例外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never make exceptions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.45,0:12:20.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}定律没有例外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An exception disproves the rule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:22.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要出去了 一小时后见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going out. I'll see you in an hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:39.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在城里有朋友吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Had he any friends in town?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.00,0:12:42.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只有一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only one that we know of, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.98,0:12:45.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}叫舒尔托少校 以前和他在一个团里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Major Sholto of his own regiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.58,0:12:56.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}案子没什么神秘的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no great mystery in this matter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.37,0:12:58.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些事实看来只有一种解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the facts appear to admit of only one explanation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.86,0:13:00.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你已经弄清楚了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh so you've solved it already?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.91,0:13:02.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have found, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.02,0:13:05.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在过期的泰晤士报上说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on consulting the back files of the Times, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.25,0:13:06.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}住在上诺伍德的舒尔托少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that Major Sholto, of Upper Norwood, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.55,0:13:07.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以前驻孟买陆军第三十四兵团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}late of the 34th Bombay Infantry, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.89,0:13:10.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于6年前死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}died just 6 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.95,0:13:13.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈德森太太 您在这儿 还真是碍手碍脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Hudson you're dreadfully under foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.60,0:13:15.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许我脑筋迟钝 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may be very obtuse, Holmes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.79,0:13:17.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可我看不出这有什么启示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I fail to see what this suggests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.53,0:13:18.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真看不出？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.57,0:13:20.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没想到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You surprise me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.07,0:13:20.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们这么来看吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now look at it this way, then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.46,0:13:24.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}摩斯坦上尉失踪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Morstan disappears.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.20,0:13:26.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在伦敦 只有一个人他可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The only person in London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.29,0:13:27.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去拜访 那就是舒尔托少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whom he could have visited is Major Sholto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.68,0:13:30.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}舒尔托少校否认知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Major Sholto denies having heard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.85,0:13:32.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他曾来过伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he was even in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.51,0:13:33.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}4年后舒尔托死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}4 years later Sholto dies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.66,0:13:35.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他死后不到一个星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Within a week of his death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.56,0:13:37.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}摩斯坦上尉的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Morstan's daughter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.39,0:13:39.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}收到了一份价值连城的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}receives a valuable present, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.22,0:13:41.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以后每年收到一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is repeated from year to year{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.08,0:13:43.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在她又收到一封信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and now culminates in a letter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.09,0:13:45.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说她是位受了委屈的女子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which describes her as a wronged woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.75,0:13:48.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她受过什么委屈呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now what wrong can it possibly refer to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.07,0:13:50.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除了她丧父以外？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except this deprivation of her father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.81,0:13:52.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卷尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tape measure, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.83,0:13:53.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.06,0:13:58.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么这些礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why should these presents{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.34,0:14:00.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是在舒尔托死后才送给她？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}begin immediately after Sholto's death{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.23,0:14:02.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除非是舒尔托的后人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless it is that Sholto's heir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.51,0:14:03.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}知道其中的秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}knows something of the mystery{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.76,0:14:06.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想要做些补偿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and desires to make compensation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.83,0:14:10.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}准备好了吗 华生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you ready Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.11,0:14:12.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就等你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.63,0:14:15.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还有别的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you any alternative theory{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.32,0:14:16.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以解释这些事实？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that will meet the facts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:18.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但 这真是个奇怪的补偿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what a strange compensation!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.06,0:14:19.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太奇怪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how strangely made!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.99,0:14:21.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几点了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.76,0:14:23.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}6点15\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a quarter past the hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.72,0:14:37.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚上好 埃利斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evening Ellis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.32,0:14:38.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚上好 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evening sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.43,0:14:41.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why should somebody{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.68,0:14:42.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在才给她写信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}write her a letter now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.81,0:14:44.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而不是6年前呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rather than 6 years ago?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.96,0:14:47.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}信上又说要还她公道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Again, the letter speaks of giving her justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.61,0:14:48.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她可以得到什么公道呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What justice can she have?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.81,0:14:49.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要说是她父亲还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is too much to suppose{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.94,0:14:51.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那未免太乐观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that her father is still alive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.42,0:14:53.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是你又不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there's no other injustice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.45,0:14:54.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她还受过什么别的委屈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in her case that you know of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.98,0:14:56.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实有些费解之处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are difficulties{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.19,0:14:59.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但事情总是如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but there are always difficulties.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.59,0:15:05.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚上好 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening Mr Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.58,0:15:07.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我没…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do hope I'm not...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.40,0:15:08.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}晚上好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good evening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:17.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}顺便说一声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.50,0:15:20.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在爸爸的书桌里找到张奇怪的纸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a curious paper was found in Papa's desk, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.65,0:15:22.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没人能看懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which nobody could understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.34,0:15:25.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想这未必和案子有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't suppose it is of the slightest importance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.41,0:15:27.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我想你可能愿意看一看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I thought you might like to see it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.18,0:15:28.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以我带来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I brought it with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.02,0:15:32.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这纸像是印度产的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The paper appears to be of Indian manufacture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.57,0:15:35.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以前被钉在了板子上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At some point it's been pinned to a board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.80,0:15:39.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上面的图表像是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The diagram upon it appears to be the plan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.17,0:15:43.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大建筑物草图的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of part of a large building{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.36,0:15:46.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}里面有许多房间 走廊和过道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with numerous halls, corridors, and passages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.41,0:15:50.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上面用红笔画了个十字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a cross in red ink, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.50,0:15:55.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在一边写着"从左边3.37"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and on the side is written "3.37 from left."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.59,0:15:58.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这有一个奇怪的象形文字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a curious hieroglyphic, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.28,0:16:01.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}四个签名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sign of four{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.33,0:16:04.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Kartar Singh和Indigo Singh\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kartar Singh, Indigo Singh, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.27,0:16:07.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Jagodish Singh和Jonathan Small\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jagodish Singh, Jonathan Small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.22,0:16:10.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这纸像是在钱夹里小心收藏过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears it has been kept carefully in a pocketbook, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.78,0:16:12.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为纸两边都很干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the one side is as clean as the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.44,0:16:16.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是在他的钱夹里发现的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was in his pocketbook that we found it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.85,0:16:19.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好好保管 摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Preserve it carefully, Miss Morstan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.20,0:16:22.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在我觉得这个案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I begin to suspect that this case may be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.14,0:16:24.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}似乎比最初想像的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}much deeper and more subtle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.52,0:16:27.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更深奥更复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than I ever first supposed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.10,0:17:16.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们就是摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, are you the parties{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.29,0:17:17.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和她的同伴吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who come with Miss Morstan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.99,0:17:18.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我就是摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm Miss Morstan, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.63,0:17:20.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这两位是我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and these 2 gentlemen are my companions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.55,0:17:22.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您得向我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must ask you to give me your word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.61,0:17:24.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您的两位同伴中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that neither of your companions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.09,0:17:25.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a police officer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.53,0:17:27.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我保证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I give you my word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.63,0:18:08.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的主人正在等候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sahib awaits you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.18,0:18:12.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让他们进来 我的男仆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show them in, Khitmutgar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.09,0:18:14.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直接把他们带到我这儿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show them straight in to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.78,0:18:22.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿意为您效劳 摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your servant, Miss Morstan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.07,0:18:26.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}愿意为两位效劳 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your servant, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.28,0:18:28.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.76,0:18:29.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.76,0:18:32.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进我这间小屋子来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come in to my little sanctum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.90,0:18:35.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你们不会介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust you have no objection{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:38.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}烟草味儿吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to tobacco smoke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.69,0:18:41.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有香油味儿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The balsamic odor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:44.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}东方烟草\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Eastern tobacco?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.59,0:18:47.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有点紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am a little nervous{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.02,0:18:52.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发现我的水烟袋是无上的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I find my hookah to be an invaluable...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:09.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}镇静剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sedative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.85,0:19:14.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}打扰了 舒尔托先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will excuse me Mr. Sholto{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.44,0:19:17.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您让我来这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I am here at your request{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.99,0:19:19.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是想告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to learn something, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.45,0:19:21.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么事情呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which you desire to tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.68,0:19:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天有些晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is getting very late and I should wish{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.05,0:19:25.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望谈话越简短越好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the interview to be as short as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.04,0:19:30.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯 要花些时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well it must take some time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.58,0:19:36.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我们要去诺伍德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For we have to go to Norwood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.08,0:19:39.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}见我哥哥巴塞洛缪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to see brother Bartholomew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.69,0:19:44.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都要去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must all see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.66,0:19:50.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许我们可以说服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if we can get the better{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:55.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我哥哥巴塞洛缪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of brother Bartholomew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.54,0:19:58.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他对我发了火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is angry with me for{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.03,0:20:05.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我采取了我以为正确的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}taking the course that has seemed right to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.31,0:20:06.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot imagine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.65,0:20:11.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当他生气的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what a terrible fellow he is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.26,0:20:14.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会是个多么难缠的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when he is angry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.86,0:20:18.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我们去诺伍德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we are to go to Norwood, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.46,0:20:21.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最好还是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it would perhaps be as well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.13,0:20:22.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在就动身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if we were start at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.04,0:20:23.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.68,0:20:25.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那不合适\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No that would hardly do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.99,0:20:27.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不知道怎么和他说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what he would say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.41,0:20:29.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我们这么唐突去见他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if we came upon him in that sudden way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.83,0:20:33.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我必须让你们做好准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No I must prepare you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.23,0:20:36.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把咱们彼此的处境\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by showing you where we all stand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.05,0:20:39.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先谈一谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to each other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:46.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}首先我要把我知道的一些事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must lay the facts before you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.66,0:20:50.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as I know them myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.68,0:21:01.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲 就是已故的约翰·舒尔托少校\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father, the late Major John Sholto, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.18,0:21:07.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大约11年前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}came to live at Pondicherry Lodge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.86,0:21:09.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来到上诺伍德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in Upper Norwood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.14,0:21:12.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}定居于庞第皆瑞别墅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some 11 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.94,0:21:15.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在印度发了财\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he had prospered in India{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.84,0:21:17.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and brought back with him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.99,0:21:20.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一大笔钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a considerable sum of money, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.62,0:21:24.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有一批珍贵的古董\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a collection of valuable curiosities, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.13,0:21:28.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和几个印度的仆人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a staff of native servants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.39,0:21:30.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With these advantages{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.18,0:21:33.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他生活得很富裕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he lived in great luxury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.68,0:21:36.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那时我哥哥和我正在上大学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brother and I were at university at the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.84,0:21:39.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然而 我们确实清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did know, however, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.24,0:21:41.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有些秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that some mystery, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.23,0:21:43.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}某种存在的危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some positive danger, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.74,0:21:47.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}藏在我父亲的心里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}overhung our father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.18,0:21:51.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他非常害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was very fearful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.89,0:21:54.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}独自一人外出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of going out alone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.69,0:21:58.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他雇了2个职业拳击手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he employed 2 prizefighters{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.38,0:21:59.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}保护他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to guard him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.54,0:22:02.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威廉斯 今晚送你们来的那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Williams, who drove you here tonight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.97,0:22:04.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是其中之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.48,0:22:05.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出于某种原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For some reason, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.87,0:22:07.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他从不告诉我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he never told anyone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.36,0:22:10.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲对装有木腿的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my father had a marked aversion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.88,0:22:13.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}格外提防\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to men with wooden legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.97,0:22:16.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On one occasion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.20,0:22:17.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他竟然开枪打伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he actually fired his revolver{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.78,0:22:20.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个只有一条腿的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at a one-legged man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.81,0:22:24.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那人只不过是个平常的商贩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A harmless tradesman as it turned out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.30,0:22:34.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我记得当时我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I remember we have to pay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.39,0:22:37.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}赔了很大一笔钱才了事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a considerable sum to hush it up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.91,0:22:41.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后 突然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then suddenly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.10,0:22:48.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲收到了一封信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my father received a letter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.31,0:22:54.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那封信对他是很大的打击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a great shock to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.48,0:23:06.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.45,0:23:09.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从房间出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of the room!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.54,0:23:11.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从房间出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Out of the room!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.65,0:23:29.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}信上说了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was in the letter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.85,0:23:33.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们永远不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we could never discover?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.33,0:23:38.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲多年身患\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For years my father had suffered{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.64,0:23:41.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}脾脏肿大的毛病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with an enlarged spleen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.90,0:23:43.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从那时起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and from that moment on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.40,0:23:45.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的病情变得更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he became rapidly worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.52,0:23:51.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一天晚上医生通知我们说 没希望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But one night the doctor informed us there was no hope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.44,0:23:56.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要我们听他的最后的遗嘱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that he wished to make a last communication to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.29,0:24:01.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear family, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.64,0:24:08.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在印度的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when we were in India{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.86,0:24:12.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的朋友 摩斯坦和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my friend, Morstan and I, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.39,0:24:16.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得到了一大笔的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}came into possession{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.37,0:24:18.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宝物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of a considerable treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.28,0:24:24.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把它们带回了这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought it home with me to this house, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.11,0:24:28.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至今还在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where it's still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.43,0:24:35.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那天 摩斯坦先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the day, Mr. Morstan, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.32,0:24:39.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从印度回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had arrived home from the East.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.82,0:24:44.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他直接找到这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He came straight to this house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.40,0:24:48.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}指责我独吞了财宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to claim his share.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.69,0:24:51.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们发过誓 舒尔托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gave our word Sholto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.63,0:24:52.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个诺言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.61,0:24:54.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们发过毒誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gave our word and our oath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.86,0:24:57.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}another time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.29,0:24:59.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一种生活 另一个世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}another life, another world, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.27,0:25:01.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个庄严的诺言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a solemn promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.11,0:25:03.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你背叛了我 摩斯坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tried to betray me Morstan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.78,0:25:06.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你敢背叛我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you dare to cross me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.69,0:25:12.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.47,0:25:15.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他死了 Altada\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man is dead Altada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.15,0:25:17.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不用害怕 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have nothing to fear Sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.20,0:25:19.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下面的我来安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will arrange everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.32,0:25:23.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一会他就弄完了 摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And soon it was done Miss Morstan, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.62,0:25:26.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然是极其秘密的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in secrecy of course{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.13,0:25:29.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是不失尊重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but with respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.77,0:25:31.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这确实很可耻 舒尔托先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is disgraceful Mister Sholto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.55,0:25:34.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你父亲的行为是不可原谅的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father's behavior was quite unforgivable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.86,0:25:37.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拜托 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.87,0:25:41.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我打心底知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew in my heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.66,0:25:44.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他已死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he was dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.01,0:25:48.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我父亲并不孤单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father was not alone then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.81,0:25:54.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很高兴他没受罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm glad he didn't suffer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.31,0:25:56.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你很勇敢 摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're very brave Miss Morstan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.19,0:26:01.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在我所关心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What concerns me now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.43,0:26:02.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是那场争吵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the wishing for this quarrel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.88,0:26:04.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不能想象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot imagine how my father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.41,0:26:06.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲是怎么卷进这个财宝的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}came to be involved with that treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.30,0:26:11.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕事情还不清楚 摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid that is not clear Miss Morstan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.20,0:26:12.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只能告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can only tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.01,0:26:21.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲对我们说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my father's instructions concerning it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.57,0:26:32.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}贪婪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The greed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.91,0:26:35.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可憎的贪婪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accursed greed that has been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.78,0:26:37.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一生折磨着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my besetting thing throughout my life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.45,0:26:41.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我抢走了她的财产\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has robbed her of the treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.07,0:26:45.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少有一半是她的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half of which, at least, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.42,0:26:47.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应该还给她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}should be hers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.44,0:26:57.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们看这串项链\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see that chaplet there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.23,0:27:05.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想把它送给她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had the design of sending it to her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.00,0:27:11.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是又舍不得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but could not bear to part with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.49,0:27:13.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.49,0:27:16.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的儿子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my sons{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.97,0:27:19.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一定要让摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}must see that Miss Morstan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.91,0:27:33.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}得到属于她的一份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gets her share of the treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.39,0:27:38.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把他赶走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.18,0:27:44.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 把他赶走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For Christ's sake get him away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.99,0:27:48.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们冲到窗前 跑到花园中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We ran to the window and out into the garden{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.12,0:27:51.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是那个人已经没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the intruder was gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.75,0:27:54.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我父亲死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father was dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.72,0:27:58.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不久我们就得到了更确切的证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We soon had more striking proof that there were{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.84,0:28:02.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有秘密组织在盯着我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}secret agencies that work all around us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.51,0:28:07.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第二天有人闯进我父亲的卧室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The next day my father's bedroom was broken into{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.98,0:28:13.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个被放在了他的胸前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this was fixed to his chest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.86,0:28:18.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remarkable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.89,0:28:22.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是印度锡克教数字4的标记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the Sikkh symbol for the numeral 4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.99,0:28:28.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这张纸是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the paper means{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.98,0:28:31.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有我们神秘的来访者是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and who our secret visitor or visitors were{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.60,0:28:34.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we never found out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.23,0:28:42.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我哥哥和我都很兴奋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And my brother and I were much excited{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.46,0:28:43.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们能想象出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as you could imagine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.72,0:28:45.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都是由于我父亲说的财宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the treasure that my father had spoken{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.51,0:28:47.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 我们竭尽所能都没有找到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but try as we might we couldn't find it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.80,0:28:50.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们有些发狂 只要想到收藏宝藏的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was maddened to think that the hiding place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.20,0:28:53.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在他临终的嘴边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was on his very lips when he died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.36,0:28:57.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从这个项链上 我们就可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could judge the splendor of the riches{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.34,0:28:59.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看出这批财宝的贵重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the chaplet, which he had taken out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.85,0:29:02.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这几颗珍珠都很值钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pearls were evidently of great value, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.55,0:29:06.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我哥哥不愿意把它们给她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my brother was averse to part with them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.63,0:29:09.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在对待朋友上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for, between friends, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.68,0:29:13.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他也有点我父亲的缺点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he was a little inclined to my father's fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.47,0:29:16.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我所能做的只是规劝他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it was all I could do was to persuade him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.61,0:29:18.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}允许我每隔一段时间给摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to allow me to send Miss Morstan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.73,0:29:21.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一颗拆下来的珍珠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a detached pearl at regular intervals{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.88,0:29:24.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这样她就不会生活拮据了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so that she would not feel destitute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.47,0:29:27.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是好心眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a kindly thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.03,0:29:30.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真是太好心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No it was very good of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.73,0:29:35.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们只是你的托管人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were your trustees{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.25,0:29:37.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是我的看法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was the way I looked at it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.64,0:29:41.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然我哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}although my brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.22,0:29:42.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和我看法不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did not altogether see it in that light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.01,0:29:44.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们自己有很多钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had plenty of money ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.41,0:29:48.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用卑劣的手段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would have been in such bad taste{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.85,0:29:51.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对待一位年轻的女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to have treated a young lady{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.68,0:29:54.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}实在是情理难容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in so scurvy a fashion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.38,0:29:57.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在昨天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yesterday an event{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.57,0:30:03.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发生了一件极其重要的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of extreme importance occurred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.81,0:30:11.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们找到财宝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We, found of the treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.57,0:30:16.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因此 我立即联系了摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hence my instant communication to you Miss Morstan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.26,0:30:20.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们现在要做的就是去诺伍德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now all we have to do is to drive to Norwood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.21,0:30:23.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向他索要我们应得的那份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and claim our share.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.21,0:30:28.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在他眼中 我们也许是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shall be expected, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.91,0:30:33.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不受欢迎的客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if not entirely welcome, visitors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.36,0:30:36.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你从头到尾做得都很好 舒尔托先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have done well from first to last Mr. Sholto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.98,0:30:45.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我身体很弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My health is somewhat fragile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.17,0:30:50.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只能算个病人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am compelled to be a valetudinarian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.24,0:30:54.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.62,0:31:09.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}花园的每个角落我们都挖过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We dug up every inch of the garden{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.68,0:31:12.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有任何发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without discovering anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.75,0:31:17.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我哥哥巴塞洛缪很聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Brother Bartholomew is such a clever fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.48,0:31:20.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们知道他是怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know how he found out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.21,0:31:21.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发现宝藏的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where the treasure was?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.99,0:31:23.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.80,0:31:25.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他测量了每个角落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He made measurements everywhere, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.74,0:31:26.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all along the top, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.97,0:31:29.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}侧面 里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}along the side, inside and he found out{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.94,0:31:33.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最后在离房顶4英尺的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he was 4 foot out at the top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.39,0:31:36.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们发现了父亲建的一个小顶楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We found our father made a false room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.77,0:31:42.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在板条灰泥天花板上打了个洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he smashed through the lath and the plaster{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.59,0:31:45.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宝箱就在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and there was the treasure chest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.11,0:31:47.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}椽木上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lying across the rafters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.72,0:31:49.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他估算了一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has computed the value of the treasure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.66,0:31:55.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}差不多超过… 50万英镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be more than one half million sterling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.17,0:32:00.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是伯恩斯通夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Mrs. Bernstone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.07,0:32:03.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伯恩斯通夫人是这房子里唯一的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Bernstone is the only lady in the house{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.90,0:32:05.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这等着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wait here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.91,0:32:21.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}撒迪厄斯先生 真高兴您来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Mr. Thaddeus I'm so glad you've come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.58,0:32:25.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真高兴您来了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so glad you've come, sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.39,0:32:30.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是个奇怪的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a strange place!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.12,0:32:35.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好像全英国的鼹鼠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It looks as if all the moles in England{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.57,0:32:37.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都跑到这来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have been let loose in it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.86,0:32:42.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巴塞洛缪好像出事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something amiss with Bartholomew{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.40,0:32:43.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进屋去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Into the house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.53,0:33:01.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝保佑 看您这张甜美安静的脸多好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bless your sweet, calm face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.76,0:33:04.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这一天可真是受够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, but I have been sorely tried this day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.25,0:33:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么了 伯恩斯通夫人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How Mrs. Bernstone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.47,0:33:10.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}巴塞洛缪先生把自己关在屋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Bartholomew shut himself in his room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.15,0:33:12.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没和我说一句话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I can't get a word out of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.21,0:33:14.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His bed hasn't been slept in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.28,0:33:17.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也没下楼吃过东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he hasn't been down for any food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.79,0:33:20.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他工作的时候我不敢打扰他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I dare not disturb him at his work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.60,0:33:22.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道他工作时候的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what he's like when it's his work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.01,0:33:25.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}照顾好她 摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look after her Miss Morstan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.60,0:33:33.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来 冷静一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There, there do try to calm down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.16,0:33:35.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瞧 一切都会好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look I'm sure everything will be all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.33,0:33:37.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望你是对的 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do hope your right Miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.75,0:33:39.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坐这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.68,0:33:50.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.61,0:34:02.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哪个门？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is the door?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.88,0:34:41.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}里面情况很糟糕 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something devilish in this, Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.14,0:35:22.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又是四签名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sign of the four again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.73,0:35:24.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这一切是怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What in God's name does it all mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.76,0:35:26.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谋杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means murder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.60,0:35:33.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}昨晚我们把财宝搬下来 放在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We brought the treasure down there last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.28,0:35:37.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now its gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.67,0:35:38.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是几点的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What time is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.75,0:35:42.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不… 不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.82,0:35:46.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想是6点或是7点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think six, or seven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.92,0:35:53.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我走后听见他锁门了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard him lock the door after I left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.42,0:35:57.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一定是最后见到他活着的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must have been the last person to see him alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.78,0:36:00.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now he's dead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.15,0:36:07.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想是我干的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you think I did it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.54,0:36:09.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有 为什么我要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't, why should I, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.56,0:36:10.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不会让你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't have wanted you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.55,0:36:11.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不会请你来…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't have asked you to...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.15,0:36:15.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll go mad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.37,0:36:16.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}冷静 冷静 冷静 舒尔托先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentle, gently, gentle Mr. Sholto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.71,0:36:18.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我建议你报警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest that you go down to the police station{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.96,0:36:19.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把你知道的一切告诉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and tell them everything that you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.50,0:36:21.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们等你回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shall wait here until you return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.32,0:36:24.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.11,0:36:25.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.24,0:36:27.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上面有毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forgive me, its poisoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.02,0:36:31.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 我们还有些时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well Watson we have a little time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.50,0:36:33.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弄清楚整个过程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let's make the most of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.21,0:36:35.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这件事真是扑朔迷离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe this is an Insoluble mystery to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.78,0:36:37.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不止没搞明白 反而越来越糊涂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It grows darker instead of clearer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.53,0:36:39.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 不 马上就会水落石出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no, no it clears every instant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.27,0:36:40.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只要再弄清几个环节\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only require a few missing links{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.77,0:36:43.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就可以把整个案子串联起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to have an entirely connected case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.58,0:36:45.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在案子看上去很简单了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simple as the case seems now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.18,0:36:48.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有几件事不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there may be something deeper underlying it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.13,0:36:50.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些人怎么进来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did these people come{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.38,0:36:51.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么出去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and how did they go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.38,0:36:52.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.66,0:36:54.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要从这种地方搬走财宝箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well it takes more than one, perhaps more than 2{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.79,0:36:57.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}需要不止一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to remove a heavy treasure chest{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.90,0:36:59.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许两人以上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from a place like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.11,0:37:01.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}门从昨晚就没开过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The door hasn't been opened since last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.07,0:37:03.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那这些窗户呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how about these windows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.39,0:37:11.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}插销在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Snibbed on the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.38,0:37:13.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有合叶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No hinges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.98,0:37:15.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}屋顶离的很远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roof quite out of reach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.83,0:37:17.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}附近没有排水管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No drainpipe near.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.97,0:37:21.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人可能从这进来 看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet someone has entered this way look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.18,0:37:23.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.08,0:37:26.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}窗台上有足迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See that a scuff on the sill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.71,0:37:33.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看这个 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at this Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.99,0:37:36.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这儿和这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this and this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.92,0:37:38.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这真是个非常好的证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a very pretty demonstration.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.79,0:37:41.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但那不是脚印\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that's not a footmark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.07,0:37:42.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这东西对我们更有价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something much more valuable to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.92,0:37:44.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个靴子的痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is mark of a boot and this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.86,0:37:50.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是木腿的痕迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this the mark of the timber toe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.42,0:37:52.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是一个有一条木腿的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is a wooden-legged man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.89,0:37:54.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而另一个人是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And someone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.79,0:37:58.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很能干 很灵活的同谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A very able and efficient ally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.91,0:38:01.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你能从那个墙爬过来吗 华生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Could you scale that wall, Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.23,0:38:11.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肯定不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.79,0:38:12.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有帮忙是不能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I aid it is so{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.86,0:38:15.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但假定你有一个朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but suppose you had a friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.74,0:38:19.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他把这根结实的绳子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who lowered you this good stout rope{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.48,0:38:21.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}牢牢的系在那个环子上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}securing it first to this ring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.68,0:38:24.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想只要你有力气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think if you were an active man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.59,0:38:26.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就可以爬过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'd be able to swarm up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.28,0:38:27.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使是装着木腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wooden leg and all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.64,0:38:29.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你离开的时候 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You would depart, of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.33,0:38:30.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以用同样的方式 你的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the same fashion, and then your friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.33,0:38:34.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会收起绳子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would pull up the rope, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.02,0:38:38.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关上窗子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}close the window, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.63,0:38:39.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从里面栓牢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}snib it on the inside, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.01,0:38:42.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把它复原成来时候的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and depart in the manner he originally came.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.99,0:38:48.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}情况比刚才更莫名其妙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well the thing grows more unintelligible than ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.60,0:38:50.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个神秘的同谋是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about this mysterious ally?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.99,0:38:52.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是怎样进屋的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did he get into the room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.80,0:38:55.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不错 那个同谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, this ally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.67,0:38:57.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他使案子变得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He lifts this case{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.09,0:38:59.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}异乎寻常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the regions of the commonplace.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.39,0:39:03.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}门是关着的 窗户够不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well the door is locked; the window inaccessible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.08,0:39:05.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}壁炉又太小\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The grate's too small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.48,0:39:06.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么办到的呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.47,0:39:07.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你总是不跟着我的思路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not follow my precept.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.91,0:39:09.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我和你说过多少次了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How often have I said to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.20,0:39:10.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一旦你排除掉不可能的因素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that once you have eliminated the impossible, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.96,0:39:12.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不论剩下什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whatever remains, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.55,0:39:14.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不论多么不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}however improbable, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.14,0:39:16.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那一定是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}must be the truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.94,0:39:23.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他肯定是从屋顶下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must of come in through the roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.17,0:39:24.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好极了 华生 拿着灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent Watson, hold this lamp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.76,0:39:26.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}咱们去查看一下上面的空间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us carry our research to the room above{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.01,0:39:31.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是放财宝的密室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the secret room in which the treasure was found.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.01,0:39:37.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天窗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The skylight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.39,0:39:55.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 是个小孩干了这么恐怖的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes a child has done this horrid thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.06,0:39:57.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我忘记了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My memory failed me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.10,0:40:00.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我本应该料到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for I should have been able to foretell it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.84,0:40:02.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里没什么可搜的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nothing we can learn from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.35,0:40:03.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们下去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us go down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.11,0:40:15.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对那些脚印有什么结论？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is your theory about those footmarks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.85,0:40:17.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 请你自己做点分析\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear Watson, try a little analysis yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.62,0:40:18.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道我的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know my methods.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.55,0:40:19.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应用他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apply them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.62,0:40:20.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从这些证据上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot conceive of anything{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.94,0:40:22.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么也总结不出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that will cover the facts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.60,0:40:25.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不久就会清楚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.48,0:40:45.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们运气好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.78,0:40:49.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的小同谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our little ally{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.35,0:40:51.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}踩到了木馏油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has trod in the creosote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.10,0:41:00.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahh, look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.83,0:41:03.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们住的小地方还真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite a nice little place you got here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.67,0:41:07.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.88,0:41:10.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我猜是那些法律的代表者们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Representatives of the law{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.07,0:41:12.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要不就是我犯了非常大的错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless I'm very, very much mistaken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.39,0:41:13.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.65,0:41:16.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在他们来之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before they come{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.10,0:41:18.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你对这个可怜的家伙有什么看法？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what do you make of this poor fellow?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.19,0:41:20.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}肌肉像木板一样僵硬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The muscles are stiff as a board.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.92,0:41:23.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}极其强烈的收缩状态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A state of extreme contraction, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.61,0:41:26.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}远比一般的死后僵硬要厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}far exceeding the usual rigor mortis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.69,0:41:27.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.79,0:41:30.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再加上脸部的扭曲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coupled with this distortion of the face, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.11,0:41:31.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希波克拉底式的笑容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Hippocratic smile, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.92,0:41:35.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是被老派作家称为讥笑的笑容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}risus sardonicus, as the old writers called it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.18,0:41:37.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你心里有结论了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what would that suggest to your mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.36,0:41:40.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}死于某种植物性生物碱的剧毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death from a powerful vegetable alkaloid{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.91,0:41:42.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}某种番木鳖碱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some strychnine-like substance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.76,0:41:44.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}能造成破伤风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that produces tetanus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.80,0:41:49.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.13,0:41:50.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}右转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the right, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.95,0:41:52.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们 向右转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}come on along gentleman to the right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.77,0:41:55.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上楼梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up these stairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.55,0:42:02.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这根荆棘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This thorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.14,0:42:05.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}英国荆棘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}old English thorn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.89,0:42:11.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想不应该让摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it is not right that Miss Morstan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.70,0:42:13.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}呆在这个遭殃的屋子里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}remain in this stricken house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.76,0:42:16.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你把他送回家去 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest you slip away and take her home Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.12,0:42:18.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后去宾奇巷 3号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then go to 3 Pinchin Lane, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.19,0:42:20.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}朗伯斯区 找托比来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lambeth and ask for Toby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.27,0:42:21.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宾奇巷 3号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}3 Pinchin Lane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.32,0:42:23.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我宁愿要托比的帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather have Toby's help than that of the{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.20,0:42:25.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比全伦敦的警察都得力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}whole protective force London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.27,0:42:33.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这成什么样子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well here's a pretty business!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.37,0:42:38.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}屋里挤得像个养兔场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Place is as full as a rabbit-warren!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.94,0:42:42.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你一定还记得我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you better recollect me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.57,0:42:45.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}埃瑟尔尼 琼斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Athelney Jones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.83,0:42:51.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我当然记得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, of course I do!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.76,0:42:56.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生 大理论家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sherlock Holmes, the theorist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.36,0:42:59.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我永远忘不掉 那次你给我们做的演讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll never forget that you lectured us all{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.38,0:43:02.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关于那件主教珍宝案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}about the Bishopgate jewel case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.18,0:43:05.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你确实把我们引上正确的思路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}True you set us on the right track then{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.60,0:43:07.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你得承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think you'll own now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.98,0:43:10.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是因为运气好而不是正确的引导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is more by good luck than good guidance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.09,0:43:12.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是一个很简单的推理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a piece of very simple reasoning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.32,0:43:14.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}算了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, come, now, come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.61,0:43:16.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别不好意思承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never be ashamed to own up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.73,0:43:23.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可这是怎么一回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But what is all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.75,0:43:25.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太糟糕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a bad business!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.47,0:43:27.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太糟糕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bad business!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.52,0:43:32.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}严酷的事实摆在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stern facts here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.04,0:43:35.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用不着理论了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no room for theories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.17,0:43:37.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是太巧了 我路过诺伍德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's lucky I happened to be up at Norwood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.90,0:43:41.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}接到报案时 我正在忙另一个案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on another case when I got the message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.15,0:43:43.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你认为这人是怎么死的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you think this man died?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.15,0:43:45.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个案子似乎不需要我的理论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not a case for me to theorize over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.58,0:43:47.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.49,0:43:49.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是 我们不得不承认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still, we can't deny{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.10,0:43:52.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有时真能一言中的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you hit the nail on the head sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.78,0:43:59.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}门是锁着的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Door locked, I understand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.34,0:44:03.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}财宝丢失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jewels worth a fortune missing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.30,0:44:03.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}窗户的情况怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How were the windows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.02,0:44:06.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}关得很紧 不过窗台上有脚印\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fastened; but there was a footstep on the sill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.66,0:44:08.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}窗户关着的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Windows fastened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.18,0:44:11.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}脚印便与本案无关 这是常识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing to do with it. It's common sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.64,0:44:19.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我猜这个人是猝死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man could have died in a fit I suppose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.40,0:44:22.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.14,0:44:23.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有一个解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.03,0:44:26.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有时我也能灵机一动呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These flashes come to me sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.99,0:44:29.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}警长 你先出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant, outside if you please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.09,0:44:32.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也是 舒尔托先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you too, Mr. Sholto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.82,0:44:38.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你怎么想的 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think of this, Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.22,0:44:40.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}舒尔托已经承认了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sholto has confessed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.74,0:44:42.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}昨晚他和他哥哥在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he was with his brother last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.35,0:44:44.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他哥哥猝死后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The brother died in a fit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.61,0:44:45.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}舒尔托带着财宝跑了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sholto walks off with the treasure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.92,0:44:46.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是这样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.78,0:44:48.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个死人倒还细心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whereupon a dead man very considerately{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.33,0:44:51.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}命都没了还起来把门锁上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gets up and locks the door from the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.29,0:44:54.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hum!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.88,0:45:00.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是个破绽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a flaw there somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.63,0:45:06.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}咱们根据常识来想想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us apply common sense to the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.67,0:45:08.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们是兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were brothers{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.13,0:45:10.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}争吵过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there was a quarrel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.85,0:45:14.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哥哥巴塞洛缪死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}brother Bartholomew dead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.47,0:45:15.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}珠宝不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}jewels gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.81,0:45:17.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而撒迪厄斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And master Thaddeus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.03,0:45:21.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}极为恐惧不安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}evidently in a disturbed state of mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.60,0:45:25.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他外表还行 但不怎么迷人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His appearance well, not attractive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.17,0:45:26.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.82,0:45:31.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我正在结网 要网住撒迪厄斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm weaving a web around Thaddeus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.60,0:45:34.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这张网要套住他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The net begins to close upon him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.45,0:45:36.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}琼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jones{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.47,0:45:39.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个小木刺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that splinter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.22,0:45:44.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想那有毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which I firmly believe to be poisoned, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.31,0:45:48.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那张纸和那根样子奇怪的木棍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that card and that curiously shaped instrument{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.08,0:45:50.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}放在桌子上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were lying there on the table.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.93,0:45:56.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从各方面来看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Confirms my theory{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.63,0:45:59.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都能证实我的结论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in every respect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.91,0:46:01.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个屋里到处是印度的古玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The house is full of Indian curiosities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.02,0:46:04.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有证据都指向撒迪厄斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All point to Thaddeus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.41,0:46:09.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.49,0:46:11.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是怎么逃走的呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how did he escape?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.64,0:46:18.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}屋顶上有个洞 警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a trapdoor in the roof Sergeant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.49,0:46:23.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让舒尔托先生进来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask Mr. Sholto to step this way?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.86,0:46:29.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毕竟事实胜于雄辩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see facts are better than theories, after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.79,0:46:32.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的看法完全得到证实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My view of the case is confirmed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.16,0:46:33.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一个天窗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a trapdoor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.66,0:46:35.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}连接着屋顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}communicating with the roof, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.12,0:46:37.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还是半开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it is partly open.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.77,0:46:39.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是我打开的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is I who opened it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.96,0:46:44.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}撒迪厄斯 舒尔托先生 我有责任告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Thaddeus Sholto, it is my duty to inform you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.93,0:46:46.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你所说的都会被记下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that anything you say will be taken down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.76,0:46:48.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能会对你不利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and maybe used in evidence against you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.74,0:46:50.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了你死去的哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I arrest you in the Queen's name{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.56,0:46:53.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我代表政府逮捕你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as being concerned in the death of your brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.56,0:46:56.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有 我说过了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't I tell you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.18,0:46:58.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别着急 舒尔托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't trouble yourself, Mr. Sholto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.83,0:47:01.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能帮你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that I can engage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.49,0:47:02.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}洗刷一切罪名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to clear you of this charge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.63,0:47:05.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要随便答应 大理论家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't promise too much, Mr. Theorist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.02,0:47:08.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事实恐怕没你想的那么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may find it a harder matter than you think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.45,0:47:10.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不但要为他澄清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not only will I clear Mr. Sholto, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.22,0:47:12.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还要给你一些信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I will give you a description{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.15,0:47:14.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}昨晚有两个人来这个屋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the 2 men who were in this room last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.72,0:47:16.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其中一个文化程度很低\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One was a poorly educated man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.60,0:47:17.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}强壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}strong, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.82,0:47:18.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}动作灵活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}active, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.64,0:47:20.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有右腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with his right leg off, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.17,0:47:22.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}装了一条木腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wearing a stump worn away on the inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.64,0:47:25.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}左脚的靴子下面 有一块粗糙的方形前掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His left boot has a coarse, square-toed sole{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.63,0:47:29.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}后跟上钉着铁掌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it has an iron band around the heel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.13,0:47:32.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是个中年人 晒得很黑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's much sunburned, middle-aged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.48,0:47:34.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这从他手掌上剥落的皮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and has a certain amount of skin missing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.87,0:47:36.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就能看出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the palm of one hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.49,0:47:38.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那另一个呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the other one?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.76,0:47:42.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一个更加扑朔迷离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's rather a curious person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.73,0:47:46.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我希望不久就能够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope before long to be able to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.15,0:47:48.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把他们介绍给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}introduce you to the pair of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.58,0:47:59.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 去宾奇巷3号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson, go to 3 Pinchin Lane, London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.91,0:48:01.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把托比带来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and ask for Toby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.55,0:48:03.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我宁愿要托比的帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd rather have Toby's help{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.26,0:48:05.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}比全伦敦的警察都得力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than that of the whole detective force of London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.21,0:48:46.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托比先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Toby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.39,0:48:51.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托比先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Toby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.18,0:48:54.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托比先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Toby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.17,0:48:55.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.60,0:48:56.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这醉鬼流浪汉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You drunken hooligan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.24,0:48:58.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再敲 我就放狗咬你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on get out of it or I'll turn my dogs on you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.29,0:48:59.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}43条狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All 43 of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.64,0:49:01.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是来找托比先生的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking for Mr. Toby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.00,0:49:04.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这袋子里有毒蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a viper in this bag, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.88,0:49:05.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你不滚远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'll tip it out over your 'ead{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.96,0:49:07.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会把它扔你头上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you don't hoof it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.22,0:49:09.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很着急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's urgent that I find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.34,0:49:10.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不想和你多说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't be argued with!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.82,0:49:15.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}1 2 3 要扔了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1, 2, 3 and down comes the viper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.48,0:49:16.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从福尔摩斯先生那里来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come from Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.16,0:49:19.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生派来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come from Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.45,0:49:28.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛克 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sherlock Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.69,0:49:30.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁会想到呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well who'd of thought it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.29,0:49:33.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欢迎你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe here you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.07,0:49:39.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生 怎么不早说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sherlock Holmes why didn't you say so, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.88,0:49:43.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.92,0:49:48.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它很调皮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh yes he does now Naughty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.47,0:49:49.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别咬他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh please don't you bite the gentleman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.04,0:49:52.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cause this gentleman is a friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.23,0:49:55.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of Mr. Sherlock Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.07,0:49:56.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and any friend of Mr. Sherlock Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.26,0:49:58.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a friend of mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.42,0:49:58.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别介意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't mind him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.94,0:50:00.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他只是向你友好地打招呼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll just give you a nice friendly squeeze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.74,0:50:01.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把它放在屋里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've give him the run of the room{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.90,0:50:04.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是让他吃甲虫的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because he keeps down the beetles something beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.96,0:50:09.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now what did you say{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.55,0:50:10.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sherlock Holmes wanted?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.77,0:50:11.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.91,0:50:12.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托比？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toby?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.93,0:50:13.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对 托比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes Toby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.45,0:50:14.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托比在左边的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe well Toby's No. 7{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.12,0:50:16.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}第7个笼子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there along on the left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.19,0:50:17.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你把这个给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you give him these{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.90,0:50:18.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它就会和你走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Toby will go along with you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.56,0:50:20.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就像只绵羊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as quiet as a lamb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.23,0:50:21.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托比 起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey Toby wake up come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.85,0:50:22.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有工作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's work for you to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.60,0:50:24.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有人来看你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A gentleman's come here to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.90,0:50:27.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托比 来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toby come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.46,0:50:31.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来 来 托比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.84,0:50:53.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来 托比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on Toby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.11,0:51:00.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.26,0:51:05.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没事了 警长 是福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right officer it's Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.24,0:51:07.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}停到边上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coach around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.90,0:51:09.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走 托比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on Toby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.46,0:51:27.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好 你把托比带来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done you've got Toby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.78,0:51:34.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从伦敦回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here comes London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.80,0:51:36.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我马上下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm coming down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.69,0:52:00.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.33,0:52:17.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.26,0:52:20.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看这个 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}look at these Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.24,0:52:23.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在排水沟里发现了这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found them in the gutter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.88,0:52:26.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 伯恩斯通夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh thank you Mrs. Bernstone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.54,0:52:30.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你闻到木榴油的味儿了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you smell the creosote?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.22,0:52:33.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}埃瑟尔尼 琼斯不仅逮捕了撒迪厄斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Athelney Jones arrested not only Thaddeus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.65,0:52:36.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也逮捕了守门人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but also the gatekeeper, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.78,0:52:37.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}管家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the gamekeeper, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.02,0:52:39.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有两个印度佣人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2 Indian servants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.32,0:52:40.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很幸运逃过一劫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was lucky to escape myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.69,0:52:43.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 你能长途跋涉吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson are you on for a bit of a trudge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.79,0:52:44.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.83,0:52:50.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你和托比比一比 顺着他们来的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and Toby game as they come{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.48,0:52:52.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它嗅觉很好使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when it's a good holding scent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.03,0:52:54.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now find him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.76,0:52:55.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去 托比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go Toby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.71,0:53:01.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}走吧 托比 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seek Toby seek.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.07,0:53:16.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}稳住 华生 稳住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady Watson steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.88,0:53:30.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}幸好昨晚雨停了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucky the rain has stopped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.21,0:53:32.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然隔了挺久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The scent will lie on the road{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.86,0:53:34.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但气味儿还留在路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in spite of their start.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.50,0:53:42.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}早上的空气真新鲜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, how sweet the morning air is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.30,0:53:47.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带手枪了吗 华生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you brought your pistol Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.83,0:53:49.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有 我带着手杖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No I have my stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.42,0:53:51.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是遇上他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the event were led to the men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.05,0:53:52.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带假腿的就留给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the peg leg I'll leave to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.58,0:53:54.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个同伙我来应付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave the ally to me come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.85,0:54:09.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这狗是怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the deuce is the matter with the dog?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.64,0:54:27.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们坐船走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They took a boat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.07,0:54:30.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少没有坐马车或是氢气球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}except they didn't take a cab or a balloon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.02,0:54:33.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们一定是在码头会面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must have been met at the waters edge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.64,0:54:39.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.57,0:54:41.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.27,0:54:45.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.42,0:54:56.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.35,0:54:59.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toby!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.88,0:55:10.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无差错的托比也出了错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's lost his character to infallibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.99,0:55:11.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.85,0:55:13.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不怪托比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toby's not to blame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.80,0:55:19.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些桶里装满了木榴油\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those barrels are filled with creosote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.32,0:55:21.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}气味儿把它引到这儿来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The scent was divided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.39,0:55:23.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这和打猎一样 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So like good huntsmen Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.46,0:55:25.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们得带着狗再走一遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must cast the dog again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.09,0:55:26.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找到正确的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and find the true one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.67,0:55:28.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toby{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.63,0:55:31.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}托比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toby{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.29,0:55:47.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们今天不走运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're out of luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.80,0:55:49.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们从这里坐的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've taken the boat from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.12,0:55:54.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些人比我想的聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These people are cleverer than I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.46,0:55:57.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 这些人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now Watson these people show{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.51,0:56:00.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事先有所准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}preconcerted management here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.08,0:56:06.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫迪凯·史密斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mordecai Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.64,0:56:10.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回来 洗洗脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You come back here and get your face washed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.04,0:56:10.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}杰克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.92,0:56:12.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh you youngin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.24,0:56:13.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你爸爸回来以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get your Dad to give you a good spankin'...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.58,0:56:15.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又要打你屁股了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when he gets back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.65,0:56:19.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是个红脸的小淘气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My what a rosy-cheeked young rascal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.74,0:56:21.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想要什么东西吗 杰克？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there anything you'd like Jack?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.68,0:56:23.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想要一个先令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like a shillin'.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.80,0:56:32.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他真是个好孩子 史密斯太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fine young lad you got there, Mrs. Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.90,0:56:35.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上帝保佑你 他一直是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lor' bless you, sir, he is that, and forward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.90,0:56:37.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我简直管不了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gets a'most too much for me to manage, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.68,0:56:41.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尤其是他爹不在的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'specially when my man is away days at a time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.21,0:56:42.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太不巧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe it's a pity about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.44,0:56:44.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还想租只船呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was hoping to hire a boat from him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.38,0:56:45.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一只汽艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a steam launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.12,0:56:46.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哎呀 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why, bless you, sir, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.82,0:56:48.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就是坐着那只汽艇走的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is in the steam launch that he has gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.95,0:56:51.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一点都不喜欢雇他的那人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye' didn't like the bloke who did the hire{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.40,0:56:53.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很粗鲁 装着条假腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not at all, very rough, with a wooden leg, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.92,0:56:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}半夜来敲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}come tappin' at our window{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.53,0:56:57.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的窗户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the middle of the night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.23,0:56:59.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后没和我交代一句就走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and away they went without a word to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.65,0:57:04.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个装着木腿的是一个人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now this man with the wooden leg, was he alone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.89,0:57:07.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许他带着一只动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think he might have had an animal with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.88,0:57:10.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一只狗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A dog?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.27,0:57:11.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不像是狗 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't look like no dog to me sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.98,0:57:14.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更像是在动物园能找到的动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More like something that you find at the zoo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.28,0:57:18.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和我说说汽艇的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So tell me about the launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.21,0:57:19.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绿底上有黄线的旧船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the old green bird with the yellow line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.91,0:57:20.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh no, no, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.83,0:57:22.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"曙光"号新刷的油漆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Aurora has just been fresh painted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.80,0:57:24.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}黑底上有两条红线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}black with a gold trim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.26,0:57:26.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 没错 白色的烟囱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe yes, with a white funnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.90,0:57:28.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 黑色的烟囱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sir black funnel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.43,0:57:31.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe yes of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.25,0:57:32.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢了 史密斯夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well thank you Mrs. Smith.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.19,0:57:33.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见 杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.51,0:57:34.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.52,0:57:44.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟这种人说话关键的就是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The main thing with people of that sort{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.23,0:57:46.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要让他们知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is never to let them think that information{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.65,0:57:48.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们的话与你有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is of the slightest importance to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.19,0:57:50.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you do they will instantly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.31,0:57:53.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们马上就会三缄其口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shut up like an oyster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.21,0:57:55.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的线索看上去清楚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well our course seems pretty clear now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.50,0:57:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会怎么办呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you do, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.63,0:57:59.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}追踪"曙光"号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on the track of the Aurora.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.07,0:58:01.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}查找这里和格林尼治之间的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would take days if not months{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.91,0:58:03.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每一个码头和卸货地点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to search every wharf and landing place{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.59,0:58:05.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要花好几天时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the harbor between here and Greenwich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.79,0:58:06.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你打算怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you propose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.06,0:58:09.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然嫌疑人以为 我们找不到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As our query has no reason to fear that he's being hunted{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.52,0:58:11.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想先去洗个澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I propose first of all a bath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.77,0:58:12.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}刮刮脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And shave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.69,0:58:15.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大吃一顿 再睡上一觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then a good meal and then some hours of sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.96,0:58:17.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}同时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the same time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.85,0:58:20.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}动员贝克街上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}mobilizing the Baker Street division{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.49,0:58:22.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}侦探小分队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the detective police force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.30,0:58:28.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}换句话说 动用非常手段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In other words the irregulars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.66,0:58:44.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个精力充沛的琼斯和这个平庸的记者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe the energetic Jones the ubiquitous reporter{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.33,0:58:45.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把这个案子给了结了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}fixed up the case between them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.64,0:58:48.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.09,0:58:52.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.53,0:59:00.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"训练有素 经验丰富的琼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Jones' trained and experienced faculties{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.04,0:59:04.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"立即着手调查案犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were at once directed towards the detection of the criminals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.65,0:59:06.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"他知识丰富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His well-known technical knowledge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.03,0:59:10.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"观察缜密细致…"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and powers of minute observation...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.82,0:59:12.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有更好的呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}well it gets better still{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.89,0:59:16.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"警署方面及时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the prompt and energetic action{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.41,0:59:17.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}负责的处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the officers of the law{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.19,0:59:18.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"展现了把警备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shows the great advantage for the{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.90,0:59:21.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}分散各地的好处"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}single vigorous and masterful mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.57,0:59:23.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太伟大了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't it gorgeous?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.82,0:59:26.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们也险些被逮捕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had a close shave of being arrested ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.13,0:59:27.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是他再来个灵机一动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't answer for our safety now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.77,0:59:29.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们也可能被认作凶手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if he has another of his attacks of energy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.88,0:59:41.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生没说起过此事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr Holmes said nothing of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.46,0:59:45.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们不能进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't possibly go in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.92,0:59:47.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱歉 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.97,0:59:50.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没事了 哈德森夫人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right Mrs. Hudson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.79,0:59:52.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们是我的客人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they are my guests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.93,0:59:59.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}听着 帽子摘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, hats off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.04,1:00:00.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我收到您的消息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got your message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.45,1:00:02.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就带他们来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I brought 'em on sharp.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.16,1:00:05.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}车费三先令六便士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}3 bob and a tenner for the tickets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.97,1:00:11.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}威金斯 以后有事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now Wiggins, in future{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.93,1:00:14.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们就向你汇报 你再告诉我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they can report to you and you to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.58,1:00:17.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这屋子容不下这么多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot have the house invaded in this way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.10,1:00:18.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oye stop that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.81,1:00:22.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.92,1:00:27.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要你们找一艘叫"曙光"号的汽艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I want you to find the steamboat Aurora.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.86,1:00:29.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"曙光"号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aurora.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.12,1:00:32.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是莫迪凯 史密斯家的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Owner Mordecai Smith, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.74,1:00:34.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}黑底有金边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}black with gold trim.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.88,1:00:36.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从Richmond到Gravesend\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Richmond to Gravesend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.19,1:00:37.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在河的两岸查找\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}both sides of the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.65,1:00:38.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.88,1:00:40.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}报酬是多少？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.27,1:00:42.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}老规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Old scale of pay{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.17,1:00:44.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找到船的孩子多给一个几尼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a guinea to the boy who finds the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.50,1:00:48.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是预付给你们一天的工钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here is a day in advance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.92,1:01:05.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要这船还停在水上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If the launch is above water{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.69,1:01:07.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些非正规军就能找到她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the irregulars will find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.13,1:01:11.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们无处不到 一切都逃过他们的眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can go everywhere, see everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.90,1:01:18.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}咱们这个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If our man had an easy task{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.00,1:01:20.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看来不难解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just as ours ought to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.98,1:01:21.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一条腿的人并不多见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One-legged men are not so common{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.68,1:01:23.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}另一个人也很特殊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and this other man must be unique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.31,1:01:28.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安达曼群岛的土著居民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The aborigines of the Andaman Islands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.19,1:01:29.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或许可以称得上是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}may perhaps claim the distinction{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.51,1:01:33.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}世界最矮小的种族了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of being the smallest race upon this earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.12,1:01:37.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们生性凶猛 怪癖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are a fierce, morose, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.62,1:01:38.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难以交往\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and intractable people, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.34,1:01:39.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但如果得到他们的信任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}though capable of forming{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.06,1:01:41.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们会成为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the most devoted friendships{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.58,1:01:43.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至死不渝的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when their confidence has once been gained.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.82,1:01:47.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于船只的遇难水手来说 他们永远是个祸害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They have always been a terror to shipwrecked crews, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:48.49,1:01:52.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}往往被他们用绑着石头的木棒击碎脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}braining the survivors with their stone-headed clubs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.09,1:01:54.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}或是用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or shooting them with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.52,1:02:00.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用毒箭刺死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with poisoned arrows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.77,1:02:03.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}通常屠杀之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These massacres are usually concluded{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.49,1:02:08.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}将人肉作为盛宴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by a cannibal feast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.97,1:02:17.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这真是一群"和善"的人啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice, amiable people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.32,1:02:38.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么时候吃晚饭 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what time would you like for dinner Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.27,1:02:40.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}后天8点半\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Half past eight the day after tomorrow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.30,1:02:53.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会撑不住的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll wear yourself out old man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.52,1:02:55.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听见你整晚上都踱来踱去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard you marching about all night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.38,1:02:58.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你真的需要些休息了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really must get some rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.36,1:02:59.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我睡不着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.60,1:03:02.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个恶魔似的问题一直困扰着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This infernal problem is consuming me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.24,1:03:03.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有消息？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No news?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.26,1:03:04.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.75,1:03:06.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None whatsoever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.32,1:03:08.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}河的两岸都搜过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The whole river has been searched from both sides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.46,1:03:09.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}史密斯夫人也没有他丈夫的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Smith has not heard from her husband, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.60,1:03:10.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.04,1:03:13.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其他的问题都解决了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be balked by some petty obstacle{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.32,1:03:16.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是这个问题一直阻碍着我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when all else has been overcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.80,1:03:48.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看见什么了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.38,1:03:51.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.34,1:04:24.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快下船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shove off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.40,1:04:27.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则我就要来赶你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you'll feel the back of my hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.12,1:04:33.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}(曙光号)
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.97,1:04:44.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不想再说一遍了 孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not going to tell you again boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.32,1:05:21.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多漂亮的一搜小船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A nice little craft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.77,1:05:24.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是条不错的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye, she's a good boat this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.15,1:05:26.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们在这里把它造好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We built her right in this yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.49,1:05:28.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在河里行得最快的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fastest boat on the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.21,1:05:30.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么停进来？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What she in for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.35,1:05:31.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}维修一下方向舵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repairs to her rudder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.93,1:05:33.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是惯例\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.35,1:05:35.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在它身上找不到任何差错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't find anything amiss with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.36,1:05:37.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今晚六点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want her in the water{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.76,1:05:39.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的船要出坞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by six o'clock tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.99,1:05:43.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}加满煤 全速前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fully coaled and steam up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.50,1:05:45.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}史密斯先生 准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right Mr. Smith she'll be ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.63,1:05:48.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}6点要全速前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six o'clock sharp, mind, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.66,1:05:52.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这两位先生已经等不急了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for 2 gentlemen that'll not be kept waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.09,1:05:54.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.21,1:06:00.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是这个诺伍德案 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's this Norwood case Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.59,1:06:03.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}总是有些麻烦困扰着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a great deal to worry and try me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.10,1:06:05.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这桩案子就是之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this case is a very dark one too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.46,1:06:07.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.16,1:06:10.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很感激福尔摩斯先生的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall be most grateful for Mr. Holmes' help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.21,1:06:11.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的朋友是个好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your friend is a wonderful man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.52,1:06:12.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁也比不上他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and not to be beat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.03,1:06:17.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也许你要等很长时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well you maybe in for a long wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.37,1:06:19.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.11,1:06:23.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"马上去贝克街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to Baker Street at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.06,1:06:25.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"要是我没回来 等着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I've not returned, wait for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.52,1:06:28.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"我已找到舒尔托案匪徒的踪迹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am close on the track of the Sholto gang.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.29,1:06:29.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"要是想看到本案的结局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come with us tonight{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.82,1:06:30.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}"今晚和我们同去"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you want to be in at the kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.97,1:06:33.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.06,1:06:36.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他又找到线索了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he's on the scent again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.05,1:06:38.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之前他也查错了方向？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been at fault too has he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.82,1:06:42.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们最好的侦探专家 有时也难免被人甩了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even the best of us are thrown off sometimes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.66,1:06:48.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.90,1:06:50.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛克 福尔摩斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sherlock Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.56,1:06:51.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.29,1:06:52.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you Mr. Sherlock Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.87,1:06:55.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 但是我可以代表他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No but I'm acting for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.39,1:06:57.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是为这个到这里来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've come about this right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.26,1:07:01.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你有什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you have any information{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.25,1:07:02.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以和我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you may give to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.94,1:07:04.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个酬金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a reward.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.37,1:07:06.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是关于汽艇"曙光"号的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it about the steam launch, Aurora?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.76,1:07:08.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只跟夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling no one but Mr. Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.78,1:07:10.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别走 进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no; come inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.80,1:07:16.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我是个警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a police officer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.90,1:07:18.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看上去就像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look like one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.11,1:07:19.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们会补偿你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No you will be recompensated{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.58,1:07:20.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为你时间的损失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for your loss of time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.73,1:07:22.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不会等太久的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not have long to wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.15,1:07:24.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坐下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.82,1:07:26.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要雪茄吗 琼斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cigar Mr. Jones?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.46,1:07:27.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, thank you for you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:34.99,1:07:36.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我说 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I was saying Doctor, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.47,1:07:38.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我认为你的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I consider your friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.23,1:07:41.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生 是一个不会被打败的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sherlock Holmes is a man not to be beat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.84,1:07:44.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他本可以成为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would have made{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.54,1:07:46.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最有前途的警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the most promising police officer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.35,1:07:47.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这话我可以当着任何人讲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care who knows it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.71,1:07:49.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}只要稍微循规蹈矩一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With a little more discipline{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.19,1:07:51.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别死抱着理论不放\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a lot less theory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.42,1:07:52.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.54,1:07:54.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你或许可以给我提供机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might offer me one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.01,1:08:02.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你这坏蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you rogue{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.56,1:08:04.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你可以去做演员了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you would have made an actor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.77,1:08:05.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出色的演员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a rare one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.90,1:08:08.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}咳嗽声惟妙惟肖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You had the proper workhouse cough, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.93,1:08:10.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}两条弱不禁风的腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and those weak legs of yours{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.66,1:08:11.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上台表演能挣10英镑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there worth 10 pounds each.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.98,1:08:14.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能胜任警官的职位 您太过奖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A police officer, I'm flattered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.63,1:08:17.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}琼斯 我要一只警用汽艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jones I shall need a police launch{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.34,1:08:18.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在威斯敏斯特待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the Westminster steps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.85,1:08:19.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最快的那种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fastest you have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.85,1:08:21.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有两位健壮的警察 你 我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}2 stout men, yourself, myself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.82,1:08:23.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有华生 都要有武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson all of us armed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.76,1:08:24.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这容易安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is easily arranged.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.62,1:08:26.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我给当地警局打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will telephone the local station.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.03,1:08:38.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到伦敦塔的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we get to the tower{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.75,1:08:41.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把船停在 雅各布森船坞的对面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we'll stop opposite of Jacobson's Yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.34,1:08:55.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是怎么找到"曙光"号的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you find the Aurora then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.11,1:08:57.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有理由相信汽艇就在不远处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I have reasons that the launch couldn't be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.70,1:08:58.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然我们看不见它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}far often despite of its invisibility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.89,1:09:01.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以 先生们 它会在哪里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So gentlemen, where could it be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.50,1:09:04.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我猜肯定不在水上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well out of the water I suppose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.78,1:09:06.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在船坞里小做修整\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a repair or boat builders yard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.76,1:09:08.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常正确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Exactly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.14,1:09:32.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个孩子正在那里等着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of my boys is waiting by the yard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.25,1:09:33.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他会给我们信号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to give us the signal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.62,1:09:35.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的计划非常周密 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You planned it all very neatly Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.81,1:09:38.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不过要由我处理这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but if the affair were in my hands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.48,1:09:40.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一定派出一对能干的警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should have a body of police in the yard{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.68,1:09:42.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等他们来了把他们都逮捕了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and arrested them when they came down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.61,1:09:43.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那绝不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which would have been never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.03,1:09:47.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个叫斯茂的人很精明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This man Small is a pretty shrewd fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:48.00,1:09:49.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如有可疑情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything suspicious{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.31,1:09:51.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他可能会再躲一个星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he would lie snug for another week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.47,1:09:54.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.60,1:09:56.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们已经到了 雅各布森船坞的对面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're opposite Jacobson's Yard now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.64,1:09:58.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要靠近一些吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shall we move downstream a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.36,1:10:02.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不用 雾气会掩护我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No this mist may be of an advantage to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.26,1:10:05.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们下去等着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must lie low and wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.32,1:10:34.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的男孩发信号了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your boy's signaling, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.58,1:10:36.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看得很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can see it plainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.13,1:10:55.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是"曙光"号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's the Aurora{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.98,1:10:57.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}像艘鬼船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}going like the devil{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.15,1:10:59.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她太快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's very fast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.84,1:11:01.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我猜我们追不上她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I doubt if we shall catch her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.35,1:11:02.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须追上她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must catch her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.95,1:11:04.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}火夫 赶紧加煤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pile it on, stokers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.51,1:11:06.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我们追不上她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll never forgive myself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.82,1:11:08.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我永远不能原谅自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if she proves to have some use.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.77,1:11:16.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再快点 再快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Faster, faster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.57,1:11:19.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这已经是我们的极限了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the fast boat they've got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.59,1:11:48.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快加煤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pile on the coals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.60,1:11:51.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}火夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stoke her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.58,1:11:52.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一定要追上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must have her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.30,1:11:54.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就算把船烧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if we burn the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.31,1:12:27.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}灯照别太晃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep the light steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.00,1:12:30.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我几乎看清他的同伙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can almost make out his companion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.17,1:13:22.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们快追上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gaining.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.35,1:13:39.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}火夫 赶紧加煤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pile it on, stoker.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.73,1:13:41.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全速前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it all the steam we've got.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.59,1:13:45.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们赶上了一些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we gained a little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.96,1:13:49.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.20,1:13:50.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及肯定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.39,1:14:04.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把灯向左边照照\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Point the light more to the left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.73,1:14:14.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}稳住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.66,1:14:55.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那艘船怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening on that boat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:58.75,1:15:00.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们自己打起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're fighting among themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.92,1:15:01.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}童格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonga, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.91,1:15:03.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}童格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonga.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.02,1:15:09.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个木腿人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The peg leg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.72,1:15:11.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}停船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.42,1:15:12.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们是警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.18,1:15:14.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}快停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cease you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.00,1:15:18.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们下地狱吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can burn in hell{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.46,1:15:21.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}停下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.09,1:15:25.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}四签名\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sign of four{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.26,1:15:28.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.83,1:15:46.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多可怕的脸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.57,1:17:59.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.68,1:18:03.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.69,1:18:05.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等他筋疲力尽了再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let him wear himself out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.66,1:18:59.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}琼诺赞·斯茂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Jonathan Small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.38,1:19:02.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抱歉 事情变成这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sorry it's come to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.37,1:19:05.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so am I sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.79,1:19:08.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我发誓 先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I give you my word gentlemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.38,1:19:11.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有对小舒尔托先生下手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never laid hands on young Mr. Sholto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.90,1:19:13.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你当然没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course you didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.62,1:19:15.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你那个小朋友杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your little friends dart killed him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.42,1:19:17.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在你还在爬绳子的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}while he was still climbing the rope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.39,1:19:28.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说这话就好像你亲眼见过一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well you speak as if you were there sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.84,1:19:43.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是那是老舒尔托少校的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well if it had been old Major Sholto{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.99,1:19:48.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我绝对会毫不手软地掐死他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have swung for him with a light heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.13,1:19:51.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在竟然因为小舒尔托而入狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But to be lagged over this young Sholto, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.62,1:19:56.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真令人心痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cursed heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.67,1:19:59.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你能向我句句属实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must make a clean breast of it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.82,1:20:01.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我还能帮你的忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you do I may be of use to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.68,1:20:06.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真像是一家人团圆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quite a family party.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.42,1:20:09.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想这瓶酒该留给我自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I reckon I'll pull that flask myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.91,1:20:17.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好了 你准备去哪儿 斯茂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, where are you going Small?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.58,1:20:20.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Gravesend的Esmeralda\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Esmeralda, at Gravesend, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.36,1:20:22.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}转道去巴西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}outward bound for the Brazils.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.39,1:20:23.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几乎就成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And nearly made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.86,1:20:25.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果当时还有别人驾驶的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another man at the engines{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.96,1:20:27.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们永远都追不上我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you'd never have caught us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.60,1:20:31.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}钥匙在哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the key my man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:33.51,1:20:36.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}河底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the bottom of the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.68,1:20:39.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}瞧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now look here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.54,1:20:41.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天你给我们带来了不少麻烦 斯茂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we've had enough of you tonight Small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.37,1:20:43.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把手铐带进来 我警告你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring the cuffs in men, I'm warning you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.23,1:20:44.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没事了 警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its alright constable{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.39,1:20:47.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不必拿手铐来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we leave the stacks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.45,1:20:49.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我建议我们回贝克街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suggest that we go back to Baker Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.89,1:20:52.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想摩斯坦小姐在那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I think Miss Morstan should be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.34,1:20:55.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不合乎规矩 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well that's not the regulation way Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.69,1:20:58.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少我可以请你喝上一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I can at least promise you a nice, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.75,1:21:01.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}温暖又美味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}warming drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.37,1:21:05.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好 各位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very well gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.45,1:21:13.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well Miss Morstan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.98,1:21:17.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很荣幸能将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am pleased and proud{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.13,1:21:21.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个贼绳之以法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to have been able to bring the thief to justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.35,1:21:24.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Justice?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.30,1:21:26.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多好听的正义啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The pretty justice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.96,1:21:30.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这财宝不是我们的 还能属于谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's loot is this if it is not ours?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.08,1:21:33.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}财宝不是他们的 却偏要给他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the justice that I should give it up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.22,1:21:34.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这就是正义？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to those who have never owned it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.20,1:21:35.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你忘记了 斯茂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You forget Small{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.16,1:21:38.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们一无所知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they know nothing of this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.56,1:21:40.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}判断不出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We cannot tell how far justice{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.80,1:21:45.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正义是否在你一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}may have originally been on your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.64,1:21:51.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.26,1:21:55.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}您说话还算公道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have been fair spoken to me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.48,1:21:58.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然说我该感谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}though I can say that it's you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.08,1:22:00.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给我的双手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I have to thank{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.80,1:22:04.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}戴上了手铐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for these bracelets on my wrists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.75,1:22:09.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可我并不怨恨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still I bear no grudge for that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.44,1:22:11.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是您想听我的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want to hear my story{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.00,1:22:14.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不会隐瞒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no wish to hold it back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.66,1:22:17.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我所说之言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what I say to you is God's truth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.17,1:22:21.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}句句都是真话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}every word of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.47,1:22:42.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我还是个小伙子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was a lad{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.80,1:22:44.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}参军当了兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took the Queen's shilling and was{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.95,1:22:48.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟随步兵三团去了印度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}posted out to India with the Third Buff's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.85,1:22:55.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我在恒河里游泳的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A crocodile snapped this off{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.14,1:22:57.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一只鳄鱼咬掉了我的腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I was bathing in the Ganges.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.63,1:23:04.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那畜生像做外科手术一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sawbones had my stump{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.52,1:23:07.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}干脆地咬掉了我这只腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the tar barrel nice and quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.13,1:23:09.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我那时还年盛体强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was young and strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.26,1:23:14.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我奉命退伍 而这个家伙…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got my discharge and this fellow...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.53,1:23:24.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}支撑着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's been a good support to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.62,1:23:29.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于是我20岁就成了瘸子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so there I was a cripple at 20.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.65,1:23:32.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我喜欢那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I liked it out there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.35,1:23:35.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在那找了一个监工的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I found myself a job as an overseer{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.61,1:23:37.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在一个经营靛青的农场里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on an Indigo farm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.45,1:23:41.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我每天都骑在马背上 所以境遇还不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was on horseback all day so that was fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.55,1:23:46.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是好景不长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I was never in luck for long, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.95,1:23:48.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事前没有一点征兆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}without a note of warning{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.69,1:23:50.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}大叛乱爆发了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the great mutiny was on us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.46,1:23:53.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一天晚上我回到农场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came back to the farm one evening to find{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:53.15,1:23:56.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}发现我的雇主和所有的人都被杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my master and all his family be murdered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.70,1:23:59.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没有等待\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.61,1:24:02.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}连夜跑到阿格拉城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On that same evening I was in the Fort of Agra, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.86,1:24:05.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是英国人控制着的最近的城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the nearest city still held by the British.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.65,1:24:08.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}古老的阿格拉城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The old Fort of Agra, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.71,1:24:10.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个古怪的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a queer place, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.10,1:24:12.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}huge, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.52,1:24:16.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到处都是通道和房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's full of passages and rooms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.65,1:24:21.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更多的是出口 数也数不过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and more entrances than you can count.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.91,1:24:24.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有很多的门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There were many gates{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.87,1:24:26.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于我是一个退伍兵 还是英国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and because I was an ex-soldier and British{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.67,1:24:28.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们让我当了一个头目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they put me in charge of one of them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.40,1:24:31.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还给我派了几个印度人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and gave me a couple of Sikkhs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.22,1:24:34.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们对我们很忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who'd stayed loyal to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.40,1:24:35.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是个偏僻的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a lonely place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.00,1:24:38.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我手下的两个旁遮普人久经沙场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My 2 Punjabis were experienced, fighting men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.70,1:24:44.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Kartar Singh和Indigo Singh\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kartar Singh and Indigo Singh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.40,1:24:56.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是叛军吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rebels?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.53,1:24:58.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No rebels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.12,1:25:00.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}堡垒很安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The fort is safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.63,1:25:03.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}河这边没有叛军士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no rebel this side of the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.89,1:25:06.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要不和我们合作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be with us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.96,1:25:09.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要不永远沉默\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or you must be silenced forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.81,1:25:11.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和你们合作干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With you how?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.44,1:25:13.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们让你发财\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We want you to be rich, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.88,1:25:17.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不就是你们英国人来这的目的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which is why you British came to this land.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.44,1:25:20.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没理由拒绝发财\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I have no objection of being rich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.95,1:25:24.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以你父亲的身体发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then swear by the bones of your father{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.76,1:25:25.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今后绝不做不利于我们的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to raise no hand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.95,1:25:27.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不说不利于我们的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and to speak no word against us now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.95,1:25:31.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}永远都不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or ever afterwards{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.25,1:25:35.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会拥有财宝的四分之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then you will have quarter of the treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.41,1:25:38.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但我们只有3个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there are only 3 of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.34,1:25:40.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Jagodish Singh 我的同胞兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jagodish Singh my foster brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.00,1:25:42.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他也有一份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he must have his share.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.52,1:25:49.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没时间了 先生 决定吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no time Sahib decide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.56,1:25:51.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.53,1:25:54.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果没有威胁到堡垒的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}provided the fort is in no kind of danger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.38,1:25:57.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.10,1:26:02.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会怎么做 福尔摩斯先生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What would you have done Mr. Holmes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.00,1:26:04.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我非常怀疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I strongly suspect{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.15,1:26:06.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我和你完全一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have done exactly as you did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.13,1:26:10.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我了解锡克人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes I know the Sikkh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.70,1:26:12.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}唬弄不了的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not a man to be trifled with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.55,1:26:18.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们那里的一个首长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of our local Rajahs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.50,1:26:20.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很有钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rich as Croesus of course, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.79,1:26:22.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他投靠了叛军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he'd gone in with the rebels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.92,1:26:26.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 他害怕万一英军再反扑回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But... He wanted to hedge his bet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.62,1:26:30.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}又留了后路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just in case the British came out on top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.24,1:26:33.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他想出个办法 把财产分成2部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he made a plot to get half his treasure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.45,1:26:35.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}藏在阿格拉城里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}hidden in the Fort of Agra{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.76,1:26:38.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}派他手下的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sending one of his men with it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.23,1:26:40.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}乔装成商人的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the guise of a merchant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.77,1:26:43.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请Jagodish Singh\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Jagodish Singh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.42,1:26:44.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就是Kartar的哥哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kartar's brother{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.61,1:26:46.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来做向导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be the guide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.96,1:26:50.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们冒着风险来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They come challenging sahib, in a major way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.06,1:26:51.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}按照惯例问他 别吓着他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}giving no caution to fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:51.75,1:26:52.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下一步怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.48,1:26:54.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们都安排好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we do what has to be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.16,1:27:08.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who goes there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.49,1:27:11.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自己人 阁下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A friend sahib.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.46,1:27:14.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先验清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A friend advance and be recognized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.37,1:27:20.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你拿的是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.08,1:27:25.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个箱子 先生 旧箱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A box sahib, old box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.43,1:27:28.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一些祖传的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Having some family papers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.26,1:27:32.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}别人拿着不值钱 自己留着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No good to nobody sahib only for myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.26,1:27:44.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}长官 我不是讨饭的穷人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sahib, I'm no ordinary beggar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.66,1:27:48.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会报答你的 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will have money sahib.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.81,1:27:51.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有你的同志们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you comrades sahib also.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.06,1:27:58.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把他带到总部去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take him to the main guardroom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.10,1:28:27.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就这样被死神紧紧包围着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never was a man more compassed round with death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.16,1:29:02.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是他逃跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that man had escaped{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.60,1:29:04.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}整个事情都会败露\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the whole affair would have come out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.55,1:29:06.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会被枪决的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should have been shot most like.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.37,1:29:12.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当时的情况下 你们哪个不会这么做？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which of you would have held back his musket?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.39,1:29:18.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Kartar要火化他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kartar was for burning him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.29,1:29:20.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是他们的宗教信仰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's there religion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.42,1:29:22.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是点火是不可能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But such a fire was impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.27,1:29:25.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Jagodish要把他扔进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jagodish was for throwing him down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.43,1:29:26.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}堡垒下的深沟里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into the great ditch below the fort{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.96,1:29:29.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下面的柴狗会把他吃干净\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where the jackal's to clean him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.99,1:29:31.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无疑问他是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No doubt he was right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.41,1:29:35.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一向对死亡有些许的敬意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm always for showing some respect for the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.52,1:29:39.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}接着我们打开箱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we turned to the box, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.73,1:29:42.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个箱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this box.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.84,1:29:48.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}里面的珍宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Inside were more gems{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.67,1:29:51.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我做梦都想不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than I could have ever even had dreamed of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.47,1:30:02.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}143颗上等钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A 143 diamonds of the first order{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.11,1:30:04.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}其中一颗叫做"大莫卧儿"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including the Great Mogul, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.59,1:30:07.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}世界上第二大钻石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the second largest stone in existence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.90,1:30:10.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}97块翡翠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}97 emeralds, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.30,1:30:13.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}170块红宝石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}170 rubies, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.15,1:30:15.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}40块红玉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}40 carbuncles, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.47,1:30:17.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}61块玛瑙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}61 agates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.21,1:30:24.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}Jagodish是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jagodish was right, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.46,1:30:27.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们这么把他埋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was a great mistake you made{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.79,1:30:30.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是错误的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}burying the body as you did{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.22,1:30:32.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你说是吗 华生？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would you not say so Watson?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.26,1:30:34.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}确实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:34.61,1:30:36.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尸体在印度没被火化的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bodies not burned in India{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.93,1:30:38.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不久就会被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are soon discovered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.26,1:30:39.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于是你和你的三个同谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you and your 3 companions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.01,1:30:43.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被起诉有罪 被叛终身监禁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}were found guilty and sent away for life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.52,1:30:46.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在安达曼群岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to the penal colony in the Andaman Islands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.83,1:30:48.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}布莱尔岛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blair Island sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:48.78,1:30:51.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}希望之城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hopetown, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.89,1:30:55.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有什么地方的名字比那儿更糟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}never was a place worse named.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.12,1:31:11.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是一个苦力之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was a place to sweat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.41,1:31:13.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个腐朽之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A place to rot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.85,1:31:16.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个死亡之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A place to die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.45,1:31:20.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在那里年复一年的做劳力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I sweated there year after year{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.16,1:31:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}直到你父亲的到来 摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}until your father arrived Miss. Morstan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.67,1:31:26.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}下士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}corporal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.74,1:31:30.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不能虐待白人囚犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you will not maltreat the white prisoner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.33,1:31:32.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是再有一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it happens again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.74,1:31:34.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你就等着受罚吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll be court marshaled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.69,1:31:39.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是我们的行政长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was our administrative officer and he gave me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.50,1:31:43.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在诊疗所给了我一个简易的小屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a nice cushy villa in the dispensary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.01,1:31:46.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是我曾经遇到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was as good and kind a Christian gentleman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.18,1:31:48.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最善良基督信徒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as I ever come across{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.18,1:31:51.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对他没有半点怨恨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I hold no grudge against him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.43,1:31:55.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你也是 小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or you Miss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.49,1:32:09.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢 斯茂先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you Mr. Small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.67,1:32:22.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我坐在这儿 想那些财宝的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well as I sat thinking about the treasure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.56,1:32:26.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我仿佛看见那所有的长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could see all the offices and the prison officials{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.53,1:32:28.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}喝酒 赌博的场景\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at their drinking and their gambling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.76,1:32:33.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}舒尔托少校从来运气都不好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Major Sholto never had much luck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.85,1:32:36.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}每晚他都输\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Night after night he was the loser.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.59,1:32:40.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有些人天生如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people are born like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.03,1:32:43.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我输光了 摩斯坦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all over for me Morstan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.25,1:32:45.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ruined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.16,1:32:47.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我得辞职了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall have to send in my paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.14,1:32:52.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你没法再\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't suppose you could manage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:53.34,1:32:54.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弄到几百块了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}another couple of hundred hey?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.40,1:32:57.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有自己的烦恼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a pretty nasty face in myself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.11,1:32:59.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我有个女儿要抚养\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I have a daughter back home to support.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.64,1:33:04.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我也有两个儿子要养活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I've got 2 wretched sons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.27,1:33:05.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}完蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ruined hey, damn pity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:08.30,1:33:14.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所以你决定要接近你的恩人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you decided to approach your benefactor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.49,1:33:15.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}摩斯坦上尉？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Morstan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.20,1:33:17.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他经常在诊疗所里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was often in the dispensary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.20,1:33:19.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}热带的气候不适合他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The tropical climate didn't agree with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.73,1:33:20.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他心脏很弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His heart was weak{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.81,1:33:22.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全身血液中毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and his blood was all poisoned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.04,1:33:25.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}知道他会把他所有的安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knowing that he would wish to share{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.38,1:33:26.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}都告诉了他的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}any arrangement with his friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:27.02,1:33:29.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}舒尔托少校？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the officer in command, Major Sholto?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.20,1:33:31.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 那看上去是最安全的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes sir it seemed the safest way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.28,1:33:32.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是你个人的私事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And is there any private concern over which{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.03,1:33:36.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你当然有权按你的方式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of course you have the power of disposing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.70,1:33:41.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来处理它们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as you think best{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.19,1:33:42.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你的忠告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for that advice sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.69,1:33:44.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you indeed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.93,1:33:46.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但事实是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the fact is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.25,1:33:48.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在这种环境下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}being in the position I am{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.92,1:33:50.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我需要帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.62,1:33:52.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哪种帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What sort of help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.02,1:33:56.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我要一个同伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a partner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.78,1:33:59.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想舒尔托少校和我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I'm sure Major Sholto and myself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.70,1:34:02.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以帮助你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would like to help you if we could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.99,1:34:05.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少我们可以谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We could at least talk about, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.40,1:34:09.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是我们同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that is of course if we can agree as to terms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.48,1:34:12.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在这样的处境下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's only one bargain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.20,1:34:13.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只有一个条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a man in my position can make.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.96,1:34:15.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恢复我的自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In exchange for my freedom{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.69,1:34:18.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有我那三个同伴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and that of my 3 companions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.12,1:34:20.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们会将宝物的五分之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we shall give you a fifth share{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.10,1:34:22.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}分给你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to divide between you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.50,1:34:24.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}五分之一？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fifth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:24.28,1:34:25.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那可不多啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That isn't very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.01,1:34:28.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}至少五万英镑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}50 thousand at the least.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.87,1:34:30.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可我们怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyway how can we possibly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.82,1:34:32.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恢复你们的自由呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}give you your freedom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.31,1:34:34.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要知道 这不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know it's impossible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:34.00,1:34:36.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要的就是一只船和足够的食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All we need is a boat and provisions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.14,1:34:38.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在Calcutta或是Madras\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are plenty little yachts and yawls{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:38.32,1:34:41.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有很多的小快艇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in Calcutta or Madras, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.16,1:34:44.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些就够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well enough to serve our purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:44.35,1:34:46.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是你一个人还好办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If only there were just one of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.22,1:34:47.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.55,1:34:49.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}少一个也不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None or all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.02,1:34:51.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们发过誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have sworn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.82,1:34:54.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}四个人要在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The 4 of us must always act together!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.43,1:34:58.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}冷静 舒尔托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm yourself Sholto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:58.75,1:35:01.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm yourself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.62,1:35:03.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想想看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}think about it man, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:03.34,1:35:04.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}想想看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.30,1:35:06.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯茂是一个守信用的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Small is a man of his word{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.24,1:35:09.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他不辜负朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he will not abandon his friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.65,1:35:14.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我们可以信任他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we may very well trust him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:17.68,1:35:20.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们第二天的凌晨见了面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We met the next morning in the small hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.62,1:35:24.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我详细写下了我们的协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had our written agreement in every detail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.97,1:35:29.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作为大英维多利亚女王\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We being officers in the Army{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.94,1:35:34.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}领导下军队的长官…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of her majesty Queen Victoria...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.26,1:35:36.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在神圣的圣经面前发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do swear on the Holy Bible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.32,1:35:39.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}永远遵守协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that this agreement will always remain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.33,1:35:40.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}永不反悔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sacred and binding to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.76,1:35:42.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在神圣的圣经面前发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do swear on the Holy Bible{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.00,1:35:45.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}永远遵守协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that this agreement will always remain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.15,1:35:47.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}永不反悔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sacred and binding to us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.57,1:35:48.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我给他们每个人一张地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave each of them a plan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.86,1:35:51.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}标出了宝藏的位置\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}showing the position of the treasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.86,1:36:01.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个把我的记忆带回到那时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh that brings back memories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:02.82,1:36:05.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}舒尔托坐船去了印度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sholto took the next boat to India, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.07,1:36:06.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找到了宝藏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}found the treasure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.81,1:36:08.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把宝藏带回了英国？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and took it back with him to England?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.78,1:36:09.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.21,1:36:11.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我们听到消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When we heard the news{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.15,1:36:15.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}摩斯坦上尉和我都很气愤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Morstan was as angry as I was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.34,1:36:16.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他向我发誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He swore to me he would go home{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.33,1:36:19.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要回去找舒尔托算账\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and settle the matter with Sholto.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.82,1:36:33.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要是他还活着 他会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And so he would if he lived{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.14,1:36:36.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是那不可能了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but that was not to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.80,1:36:46.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从那天起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From that day, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.49,1:36:49.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只为报仇而活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lived only for vengeance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.42,1:36:55.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我整天想着这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought of it by day, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.11,1:36:59.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}日夜不忘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I nursed it by night{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.09,1:37:00.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}要找到舒尔托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to get to Sholto, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.53,1:37:03.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}亲手掐住他的喉咙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}put my hands on his throat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.75,1:37:06.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是我唯一的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was my one thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.34,1:37:09.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}幸运的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As luck would have it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:09.04,1:37:11.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}岛上的一个居民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one of the islanders{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.43,1:37:13.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被带到了我的医疗所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had been brought in to my dispensary, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.60,1:37:15.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被蛇咬伤 大半条命已经没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}more than half dead from a snakebite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.65,1:37:18.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}出于人道 我尽所能帮助他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And in common humanity I did my best for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.51,1:37:20.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于是他康复过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somehow he pulled through{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.83,1:37:23.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}变得对我非常忠诚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and became very devoted to me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.66,1:37:27.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个有趣的小矮子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a funny little fellow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:29.12,1:37:31.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well you gentlemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.40,1:37:32.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们见过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}caught a glimpse of him yourselves, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.02,1:37:34.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无疑问 就在昨晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no doubt, last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.60,1:37:39.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他就是忠诚可靠的小童格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was staunch and true little Tonga.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.78,1:37:42.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有比他更忠诚的同伴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No man ever had a more faithful mate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.19,1:37:46.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是个渔夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Being by trade a fisherman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.00,1:37:49.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有一只不错的土著船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he had a goodish size native boat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.87,1:37:52.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他同意和我一起逃走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he had agreed to try to escape with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.91,1:39:08.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}10天之后 我们遇见了一只商船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After 10 days we were picked up by a trader{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.20,1:39:11.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带着一批香客 从马来开往吉达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a cargo of pilgrims from Malay bound for Gito.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.49,1:39:13.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}数月之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After many months{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.71,1:39:16.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们历经艰险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we worked our way across the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:16.80,1:39:19.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回到了伦敦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:22.27,1:39:24.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过程很精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A remarkable account.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.02,1:39:29.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 我想摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now I think Miss Morstan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.35,1:39:32.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能想看看这些财宝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}might like to see the Great Agra Treasure, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.66,1:39:34.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这将使她成为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which will surely make her{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.27,1:39:37.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}全英国最有钱的女士之一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one of the richest young ladies in England.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.29,1:39:39.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}- 华生？- 没钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Watson? - There's no key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.22,1:39:41.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想这跟铁火棍可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure our iron poker will oblige.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:09.51,1:40:11.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哈 哈 哈…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ha ha ha ha ha ha{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.03,1:40:19.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是你做的 斯茂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is your doing Small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.60,1:40:20.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.55,1:40:22.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把宝藏都扔掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes I put the treasure away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.51,1:40:25.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们永远也得不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where you shall never lay a hand on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.76,1:40:28.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有人能有权利拥有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No living man or woman has any right to it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.89,1:40:30.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除非是在安达曼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless it is the 3 men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.50,1:40:34.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}兵营里的那三个人 还有我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the Andaman Convict Barracks and myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.42,1:40:37.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我知道我没机会拥有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know now that I cannot have the use of it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.53,1:40:39.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没人会有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}no more can they.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.77,1:40:41.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我做的这些是为了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I have acted all along{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.94,1:40:44.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也是为我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for them as much as for myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.48,1:40:47.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们一直把四签名带在身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have the sign of four with us always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.41,1:40:50.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宝藏哪去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.76,1:40:52.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在钥匙所在的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where the key is{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.90,1:40:55.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在小童格所在的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and where little Tonga is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.25,1:40:58.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看见你们的汽艇要赶上我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw your launch might catch us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.00,1:41:01.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我看小童格倒在一边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I saw little Tonga go over the side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.66,1:41:07.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我把财宝放到了一个安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put the loot in a safe place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.33,1:41:09.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你骗我们 斯茂 要是你想把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are deceiving us Small if you had wished{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.93,1:41:12.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}财宝扔进泰晤士河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to throw the treasure into the Thames{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.80,1:41:14.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把箱子扔进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it would have been easier{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.60,1:41:16.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不是更容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to have thrown box and all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.51,1:41:18.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我扔得容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easier for me to throw{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.35,1:41:20.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们捞得也容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and easier for you to recover.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.71,1:41:23.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有本事把我抓住的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man who's clever enough to hunt me down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.28,1:41:25.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也有本事把箱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is clever enough to pick up a box{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.26,1:41:27.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}从河底捞上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from the bottom of the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:31.29,1:41:32.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.40,1:41:34.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很庆幸财宝没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am glad the treasure is lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.65,1:41:39.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于拥有宝藏的人来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been nothing but a curse{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.49,1:41:41.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}它只是个诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to every man who has owned it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:41.89,1:41:44.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不仅是我可怜的父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And only death to my poor father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.96,1:41:47.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有我和我同伴们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And slavery for life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:47.27,1:41:49.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}苦役的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to me and my companions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.71,1:41:51.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们的前半生都\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We spent the first half of my life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.52,1:41:54.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在安达曼修水坝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}digging a breakwater in the Andaman's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.80,1:41:57.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可能我的下半生要在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm likely to spend the other half{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.93,1:42:00.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}达特穆尔修水渠了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}digging ditches on Dartmoor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.17,1:42:05.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 责任就是责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well Holmes duty is duty{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.76,1:42:08.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}今天对你已经够通融了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I've gone rather far in bringing him here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.75,1:42:11.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我相信只有把这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall feel more at ease{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:11.16,1:42:13.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}讲故事的人送进监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I have our storyteller here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:13.13,1:42:15.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我才能放心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}under lock and key.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:15.50,1:42:19.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很感谢你们的协助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am obliged to you for your assistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.91,1:42:22.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见 华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good day to you. Doctor Watson, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.15,1:42:23.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}摩斯坦小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Miss Morstan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.81,1:42:31.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你先走 斯茂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Awe, after you Small.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.83,1:42:33.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则你要用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem a bit handy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:33.18,1:42:36.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}木腿打我真是太容易了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with that wooden leg of yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.41,1:43:24.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是惭愧 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel most ashamed that you Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.75,1:43:27.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}还有亲爱的华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you dear Doctor Watson{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.49,1:43:28.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让你们为了我的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have had to put yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.65,1:43:30.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}冒了那么多的险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into such peril on my behalf.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.45,1:43:32.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切都结束了 别这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh that's all over and forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.84,1:43:36.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}弗里斯特夫人派他的车夫 来接摩斯坦小姐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mrs. Forrester has sent her carriage for Miss Morstan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:37.57,1:43:39.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不会再给你们添麻烦了 两位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll impose on you no longer gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:39.26,1:43:40.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们一定筋疲力尽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must be exhausted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.88,1:43:42.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我承认这次行动消耗了太多精力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes I confess the reaction is already upon me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:42.68,1:43:45.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我这一个星期都会软绵绵的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall be as limp as a rag for a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.87,1:43:47.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很感谢您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so very grateful to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:47.30,1:43:50.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}洗刷了我父亲的名声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for clearing my father's name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.68,1:43:55.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也很感激您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so very grateful to you both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.48,1:44:19.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好像不太公平\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seems so unfair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.95,1:44:22.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个案子里都是你在做事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ve done all the work in this business{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.37,1:44:25.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}埃瑟尔尼·琼斯却赢得了名声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Athelney Jones gets all the credit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:29.40,1:44:31.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你得到了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What remains for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:32.69,1:44:34.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于我 我得到了解决 一件有趣案子的快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For me, the pleasure of having solved{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:34.95,1:44:37.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几乎是独自一人完成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}an interesting case almost single-handed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.69,1:44:39.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对于你 毫无疑问得到了把故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for you no doubt the pleasure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:40.71,1:44:43.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}写下来的快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of writing it up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.50,1:44:48.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以你那种通俗的浪漫的形式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in your usual flowery and romantic style.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.67,1:45:30.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}多迷人的女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a very attractive woman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.70,1:45:33.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.30,1:45:37.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我没注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hadn't noticed.{\r}
